// Overworld
#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_GamblingMan
Shhh! Don't tell anyone you found me\nhere.\pI lost it all at the Daimyn City\ngym[.] I can't face my family after\lthis.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Picknicker
Isn't the Daimyn City garden\npretty?\pIt attracts a lot of interesting\nPok\emon.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Hiker
I'm going to hike to Bruccie\nVillage soon.\pThe road there is difficult and\nrugged, and most people can't\lmanage it.\pIt's important to take the time to\nprepare before going on any\ldangerous journies.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_SuperNerd
Daimyn City is the largest city in\nKulure! It's quite the spectacle,\lisn't it?\pA lot of powerful trainers gather\nhere to challenge the Elite Four\land try to take the Champion's\ltitle.\pThey haven't succeeded since Selene\nbecame Champion, but that won't\lstop them from trying!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_OldMan
The Daimyn City gym doubles as both\na gym and a casino!\pIt attracts all sorts of people and\nis always bustling.\pThe leader, Chance, is an old friend\nof mine.\pBe careful if you find yourself\nfacing him both in battle and at\lthe game table! Ha ha ha!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Boy
I saw Champion Selene the other\nday! She looked really busy\lthough.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Biker
Daimyn City's roads are all concrete\nand tile.\pIt's perfect for a road hog like me!\nGwah hah hah!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Girl
Daimyn City is a central hub that\nconnects many routes.\pYou could make your way to many\ndifferent towns from here!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Policeman
There have been more Team Pluto\nmembers around here lately.\pThey're careful not to do anything\nthat'll get them in trouble, so my\lhands are tied[.]\pJust[.] Don't hang out around them too\nmuch, okay? They're a bad\linfluence.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_PlutoNW
Hey, beat it, kid! I'm not botherin'\nanyone here.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_PlutoSE
Hey, kid! You'll give me your\nPok\emon, right?\pNo? Agh, get lost!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_PlutoSW
Why are there so many members of\nteam Pluto in the city? That's a\lsecret!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_AlolanRaichuKid
My buddy went to the beach lately.\pHe said when he evolved his Pikachu\nwhile standing on the shore, it got\lsome weird psychic powers.\pThat's so strange! Everyone knows\nRaichu doesn't have psychic powers!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RestaurantSign
Daimyn City Restaurant\nDelicious meals for Pok\emon!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_AscensionTowerSign
Ascension Tower:\nHome of Kulure's Finest Trainers

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_ShoppingMallSign
Daimyn Shopping Center:\nFind your new favorite item today!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_LanasHouseSign
Lana's Lab: Home of the Kulure PC\nExpansion Effort

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_GymSign
Daimyn City Pok\emon Gym\nLeader: Chance\lThe High Roller Risk Taker!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_InterdimensionalResearchLabSign
Interdimensional Research Facility:\nExploring the frontiers of Ultra\lSpace

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_GuardHouseNorthSign
North: Route 9

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_GuardHouseWestSign
West: Route 8

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_GuardHouseEastSign
East: Route 10

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_GuardHouseSouthSign
South: Route 6

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_CityPlacardSign
Daimyn City: The Hustling Metropolis

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalStartsTour
[BLUE]I know all about this city, from\nthe stuff I've read about Champion\lSelene.\pI'll show you around a bit\non the way to the Pok\emon Center.\pAre you ready, [PLAYER]? Come on,\nit'll be fun!\pTo start, let's head to the Pok\emon\nRestaurant! It's just this way[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour1
[BLUE]Well, you probably already know\nthis, [PLAYER], but Daimyn City is\lthe capital city of Kulure!\pIt's in the middle of the region and\ncan be reached from most places.\pOver time, people just started\ngather here.\pAnd where people gather[.] Yup,\nthat's right!\pWith so many people here, the\nPok\emon battling scene exploded!\pStrong trainers from all over came\nhere to prove their skills.\pBefore long, a group of five trainers\nstood above the others in terms of\lbattling skills.\pThey were the first to fill the roles\nof Elite Four and Champion that we\lhave today.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour2
[BLUE]Whew, we're here! This is the world\nfamous Pok\emon Restaurant!\pIt's known for the extravagant dishes\nit prepares for Pok\emon.\pIt's said that the Pok\emon that eat\nhere perform better in battle for a\lwhile.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour3
[BLUE][.]I wonder if it's true? A buff like\nthat could give someone a serious\ledge in battle.\pMaybe I'll try it later. There's still\nso much for us to see! Haha.\pNext stop is the Interdimensional\nResearch Facility, right this way[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour4
[BLUE]The Interdimensional Research\nFacility was founded by some of\lKulure's brightest scientists.\pThey say they've been working\nclosely with the scientists in Alola\lto study a place called Ultra\lSpace.\pSupposedly there are some alien\ncreatures called Ultra Beasts\lthere.\pBut[.] That couldn't be true, could\nit? I mean, aliens?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour5
[BLUE]We got here quicker than expected!\pIt's quite something when seen up\nclose, isn't it?\pNext on the list is the Daimyn City\nPark. Let's go!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour6
[BLUE]You wouldn't expect a park to be in\nthe middle of a city like this,\lright?\pIt used to be really big, but shrunk\nas the city's development\lprogressed[.]\pStill, wild Pok\emon seem to really\nlike it!\pDo you think they ever have issues\nwith those wild Pok\emon?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour7
[BLUE]Hmm[.] It's even smaller than I\nexpected.\pMaybe I should stop by later to see\nwhat kinds of Pok\emon I can find?\pUmm[.] What's next[.]\pOh yeah! The Daimyn City Shopping\nMall! It's just around the corner.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour8
[BLUE]This is the biggest shopping center\nin the whole region.\pThey have shops lined up and down\nthe walls. It looks so big in the\lpictures!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour9
[BLUE]They say that you can find anything\nyou're looking for here!\pSure seems like a one-stop shop, eh?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour10
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Hey, you two! Fancy meeting\nyou here.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour11
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Uuuwah!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour12
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]C-Champion Selene, no\nway! You surprised us!\pWhat are you doing here?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour13
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]I was out for a walk and\nthought I recognized a familiar\lvoice, so I thought I'd come by.\p(Giggle) You two are louder than\nyou think.\pI can't believe you've already made\nit to Daimyn City!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour14
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Ehehe[.] That would've been\nme laughing, guilty as charged.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour15
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]I was just showing [PLAYER]\naround the city.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour16
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Oh, a tour? Sounds like\nfun!\pDo you mind if I show you a few of\nmy favorite places around here?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour17
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]That sounds really nice!\pOh, but we couldn't possibly ask you\nto take time out of your day.\pYou must be really busy.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour18
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Haha, I'm sure I can spare a\nfew minutes to show you around.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour19
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Well, if you're sure, then I\ncouldn't possibly say no!\pPlease, lead the way!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour20
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]That's what I like to\nhear! Now, where were we[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour21
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]It feels like just yesterday\nthat we met outside of Anthra Town.\pYou two must've become so strong to\nreach Daimyn City so quickly.\pHeehee, I'd better be careful, or\nyou two might take my title!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour22
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]This is where Daimyn City's\nPok\emon Center is.\pIt's centrally located and easy to\naccess, no matter where you are.\pTalk about convenient!\pNext, let's head over to the gym.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour23
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]And here's the gym!\pThe gym leader, Chance, has held his\nposition since before even my\ljourney began.\pHe's a very capable trainer. But I\nsuppose you'll see for yourselves\lsoon enough, won't you?\pI've got one last place to show\nyou[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour24
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]I'm excited to show you both\nthis last place.\pIt's the pride of Daimyn City -\nAscension Tower!\pThe best of the best gather there to\nchallenge the Elite Four and, if\lthey're lucky, me.\pSometimes it feels like the whole\nregion tunes in to watch the\lmatches that happen here.\pEvery challenger gets so into it, it's\nreally fun to face them!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour25
[BLACK]???: [BLUE]But they never beat you, do\nthey, Selene?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour26
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]I see you still battle\nwith Victini, the Victory Pok\emon[.]\pDo you really think you\ndeserve the title of Undefeated\lChampion, using an advantage like\lthat?\pActing so nonchalant about it is a\ndisservice to those that challenged\lyou.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour27
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Ummm[.] I'm sorry, do I know\nyou? Did we battle once?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour28
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]You don't even remember me.\nOf course not.\pYou're too busy being some heroic\nChampion. Why would you remember\lthe little people around you?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour29
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Um[.] Ali-

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour30
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]You won't be able to hold\nyour title forever, Selene.\pSomeday, someone stronger than you\nwill beat you and become Champion.\pWill you really be so bubbly, then?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour31
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]I'm sorry that I don't\nrecognize you.\pAnd, I'm sorry you lost to me, after\nwhat must've felt like a lifetime of\lpreparation and anticipation.\pBut please, do reflect on the\njourney you shared with your\lPok\emon.\pThey came just as far as you, and\nhave shared the same joys and\lsorrows you have.\pSpend some time with them, and maybe\nwe'll battle again someday?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour32
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]A perfect answer from a\nperfect Champion[.]\pUgh. I need to clear my head.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour33
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]I'm sorry you both had to\nsee that.\pChallengers come to Ascension Tower\nall the time.\pIt's natural for some to feel\ncheated when they lose, after\lthey've come so far[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour34
[BLUE]Excuse me, Miss Selene?\nYou have a match starting soon.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour35
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Oh!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour36
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]I'll be right there!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour37
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Hey, sorry you two, I have\nto run.\pBut[.] Promise me you'll get the\nrest of the gym badges so we\lcan battle someday, okay?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour38
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]You bet! We'll be battling\nyou before you know it!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour39
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Haha, I'll be counting on it!\nSee you around!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour40
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]That man[.] He kind of\nreminded me of[.]\pNo, it couldn't have been.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour41
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Hey, [PLAYER][.]\pYou recognized that guy, right?\nThat was Alistair!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RecognizedAlistair
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Yeah! He's a pretty\nunforgettable guy.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_DidNotRecognizeAlistair
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]I'm sure it was him.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour42
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Except[.] He seemed really\nangry.\pHe seemed so calm when we met him in\nFerrox Village.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_Story_RivalTour43
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Hey, [PLAYER], I'm going to\ncatch up with him and see if he's\lfeeling okay.\pIn the meantime, why don't you\nchallenge the gym? Then you can\ltell me all the best strategies!\pHaha, I'm kidding, I'm kidding!\nWe'll meet up later, okay?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_DaimynFactorySign
Daimyn City Factory ahead

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_OfferToBattle
Hey, [PLAYER]!\pI've been training my Pok\emon, and\nwe're tougher than ever.\pWant to see if you can still beat\nthem in a friendly battle?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_ChoseNotToBattle
Aw, too bad!\pI'm going to keep training. Come say\nhi if you change your mind!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_PromptForWhichTeam
That's the spirit!\pWhich of my teams do you want to\ntake on?

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_EeveeTeam
Main Team (Eevee)

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_EmraldinTeam
Backup Team (Emraldin)

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_PreBattle
Okay, we're going to go all out.\nMake sure you do your best!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_PlayerWon
Nice! You won!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_PlayerLost
Hey, don't sweat it.\nWe all lose sometimes!

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_PostBattle
That was a fun battle!\pOur Pok\emon already look a lot\ntougher, don't you think?\pHere, let me heal your Pok\emon up.

#org @gText_DaimynCityOverworld_RivalExhibitionBattle_AlreadyBattledToday
We're going to take a break from\ntraining so we're fully rested.\pCome see us tomorrow if you want to\nhave another battle!

// Facilities
#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouseWest_Guard
Daimyn City lies just beyond this\ngate. You may pass.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouseSouth_Guard
Welcome to Daimyn City!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouseEast_Guard
To the west lies Daimyn City.\nTo the east lies Route 10.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouseNorth_Guard
The passage to the north leads to\nBruccie Village.\pIf you are headed that way, take\ncare to stock up at the Rest House\lalong the way; it's a long trek.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalIntroduction
[BLUE]Hey [PLAYER]! I finally caught up to\nyou. Wait up!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalExplainsDaimynCity
[BLUE]Daimyn City is just ahead, and it's\nwhere Ascension Tower is!\pPowerful trainers come from all over\nthe Kulure region to challenge\lChampion Selene there.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalInitiatesBattle
[BLUE]Oh, I have a great idea!\pPowerful trainers come to Daimyn\nCity, right?\pWell[.] It only makes sense that we\nbattle to show off our powerful\lPok\emon, right?\pCome on, let's battle! I won't take\nno for an answer.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalLoses
Aw, that's another loss for me.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalConcludesBattle
[BLUE]Looks like you win again, [PLAYER]!\pYou and your Pok\emon are so\nstrong!\pHey, I've got something for you[.]\pI was shopping in Heleo City and\ngot a couple freebies for being\lthe 100th shopper! Isn't that neat?\pHere you go!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalExplainsMachoBrace
[BLUE]They said that can make your Pok\emon\nstronger as it battles, when held.\pOh, I should heal up your[.] Huh?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalNoItems
[BLUE]Um[.] Oops! I don't have any items\nleft! Sorry about that.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_GuardHouse_RivalOffersTourOfDaimynCity
[BLUE]Hey, I know! We're right\noutside Daimyn City, right?\pWhy don't we walk through the city\ntogether to the Pok\emon Center?\pI know a lot about the city.\nIt'll be fun! Let's go!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_RestaurantBoy
My grandpa takes me out for lunch\nevery week. It's a nice opportunity\lto catch up and chat!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_RestaurantBigMan
Urp[.] I think I ate too much[.]\nMy stomach hurts.\pIf I can't finish my meal, they'll\nmake me pay double!\pHey, you!\pYou'll take my [GREEN]Leftovers[BLUE], won't you?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_RestaurantBigMan_LeftoversDescription
If you give your Pok\emon those\nLeftovers to hold, they'll restore\lHP every turn.\pHandy, right?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_RestaurantGentleman
You can order what ever you'd like,\nmy boy. Hohoho!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_RestaurantGirl
My Pok\emon love eating here.\pThey even perform better in battle\nafterward, too!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_OldWoman
My friends and I organize a shopping\ntrip in Daimyn City every year.\pThere are a lot of really great\nsales on right now.\pI'm just waiting for them to arrive\nbefore I head out.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_Woman
My husband just disappeared on me\nand left me with our daughter.\pHe better not have run off to the\ncasino again[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_Girl
My mommy and I are waiting for daddy\nto come back.\pMommy said he's going to bring us\nCastelicones! I can't wait!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_TravellingMan_Intro
Ho ho! I am a world traveller that\nhas visited many regions.\pIn fact, I just returned from a trip\nfrom which I brought some rare\lregional Pok\e Balls.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_TravellingMan_SaleOffer
Say[.] Would you be interested in\nbuying one from me, for \$1,500?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_TravellingMan_Purchased
Wonderful! Then, take this Pok\e Ball.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_TravellingMan_ChoseNotToBuy
How unfortunate!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_TravellingMan_NotEnoughMoney
For shame! You don't have enough\nmoney for this wonderful Pok\e Ball.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_PokemonCenter_TravellingMan_ReturningTomorrow
I must now leave for\nanother trip.\pDo not fret, young one.\pI shall return tomorrow with more\nPok\e Balls to sell.\pBut now, I must bid you adieu, as\nthey say in Kalos.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher
Please don't distract me.\pI'm tracking peculiar energy signals\nwe've detected out in Ultra Space.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_BeastBallSales
Hello. Professor Sakura told me all\nabout your mission.\pWould you like to buy some Beast\nBalls?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_BuyingBeastBallsAfterIntroduction
Very good. This is what I can offer.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_WelcomingPlayer
It's good to see you, [PLAYER].

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormholeHunt_ChoicePrompt
What can I do for you?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_BuyBeastBallsChoice
Buy Beast Balls

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_TrackUltraWormholesChoice
Track Ultra Wormholes

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_ChooseUltraWormholePrompt
Which Ultra Wormhole would you like\nto learn more about?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_AllUltraWormholesClosed
You've closed every Ultra Wormhole\nI've tracked, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormholeClosed
You were able to capture the Ultra\nBeast causing this wormhole.\pGreat work, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Nihilego
This reading is coming from a flooded\ncavern in a secluded corner of the\locean.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Buzzwole
This reading is coming from a lush\njungle teeming with wildlife.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Pheromosa
This reading is coming from an arid\nsea of sand.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Xurkitree
This reading is coming from a place\nsurging with electricity.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Celesteela
This reading is coming from a\nvolcanic peak covered in craters.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Kartana
This reading is coming from a\nforest flush with verdant leaves.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Guzzlord
This reading is coming from[.]\nWithin the city?\pIf no one has seen it, perhaps it is\nunderground[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Stakataka
This reading is coming from the ruins\nof a long lost civilization.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_UltraWormhole_Blacephalon
This reading is coming from a mansion\nforgotten to time.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PCResearcher_ConversationConcluded
Good luck on your mission.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_MachineryResearcher
I'm testing the equipment to make\nsure it's working properly.\pProfessor Sakura has poured a lot of\ntime and effort into our\lUltra Space research.\pI don't want to let her down.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_TypeNullResearcher
We've partnered with the Aether\nFoundation in the Alola Region.\pOur goal is to share information and\nresources to help us both further\lour research.\pWe've sent them information on how to\nstabilize a corridor connected to\lUltra Space.\pIn turn, they've lent us one of their\n"Beast Killer\" projects as a safety\lprecaution.\p[.]Oh, sorry. That might've been too\ntechnical for you.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_TableBottomRightResearcher
We've identified strange creatures\nout in Ultra Space.\pThey are like Pok\emon, but [.] not.\nTheir bodies are utterly bizarre.\pWe need to investigate them further\nto understand exactly what they\lare.\pBecause they were found in Ultra\nSpace, they have been titled\l"Ultra Beasts\" by Alolan\lresearchers.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_TableBottomRightResearcher_PostNecrozma
Oh, it's [PLAYER]!\pI have some news you may be\ninterested in.\pWhen you challenged Necrozma,\nUltra Wormholes opened all over\lKulure briefly.\pShards of light fell from them\nbefore they closed.\pWe've identified them to be [GREEN]Z\nCrystals[BLUE], like the ones used in the\lAlola region.\pThey resonate when held by Pok\emon\nof certain types.\pNaturally, they are too powerful to\nbe left unaccounted for.\pWe gave them to the Gym Trainees\nthat frequent Tsarvosa City for\lsafekeeping.\pThey're experts on specific Pok\emon\ntypes, after all!\pIf you were to defeat them using\nonly the type they specialize in,\lthey would surely recognize your\lskills and gift these shards to you.\pI figured you would be interested in\nhearing about this, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_TableTopLeftResearcher
Professor Sakura is brilliant and\nkind, but[.] I'm worried for her.\pShe spends most of her day working\nin the lab, jumping from one\lbreakthrough to the next.\pWe're grateful for her positive can-\ndo attitude, but as her\lcolleagues, we also worry for her.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_TypeNullPrompt
The ball is labelled "Beast Killer.\"

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_TypeNullPlayerdenied
[BLUE]Excuse me[.] The creature in that\nPok\e Ball is pivotal to our\lresearch.\pPlease leave it be.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_SakuraPreoccupied
[RED]Hmm[.] Maybe if I adjust these\nsettings, we might[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_SakuraNoticesPlayer
[RED]Oh! Excuse me!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_SakuraTurnsPlayerDown
[RED]I didn't notice you there.\pI'm busy investigating some anomalies\nin our connection to Ultra Space.\pMy apologies, but I need to focus\nnow.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_SakuraTalksToPlayerFollowingAlistairsRecommendation
[RED]I didn't notice you there.\pWait[.] I sense an odd energy\nsurrounding you.\pIt is similar to the energy we've\nobserved in Ultra Space.\pAre you perhaps[.] [PLAYER]?\pAllow me to introduce myself. I am\nProfessor Sakura. It's a pleasure.\pAlistair sent word about you, and it\nseems his analysis was accurate.\pNormally, Ultra Space is too\ndangerous for civilians to visit.\pBut[.] It seems you have experienced\nit in some way.\pTell me[.] Are you willing to aid us\nin our exploration of Ultra Space?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_Sakura_PlayerUnwillingToGoToUltraSpace
[RED]Yes, yes, of course.\nWe will carry on all the same.\pIf you change your mind, please\ncome see me.\pWe could mutually benefit each\nother, I am sure.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_Sakura_PlayerWillingToGoToUltraSpace
[RED]Wonderful! We will surely make new\ndiscoveries with your support.\pThere is no pressure to help us;\njust stop by whenever you are\lavailable.\pNow[.] I have some things to take care\nof.\pPlease, come speak to me whenever\nyou are ready.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_Sakura_AskingPlayerIfTheyWantToTravelToUltraSpace
[RED]Hello, [PLAYER]. Are you interested\nin investigating Ultra Space?

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_Sakura_PlayerChoseNotToTravelToUltraSpace
[RED]Understood. Come see me if you\nchange your mind.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_Sakura_DirectsPlayerToMachine
[RED]Okay. Please step before the\nmachine. We will start momentarily.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_Sakura_StartingMachine
[RED]We're starting the machines now.\pYou'll feel a brief pulling\nsensation while you shift between\ldimensions.\pWe've sent a researcher ahead of\nyou.\pPlease speak to them when you wish\nto return.\pSafe travels!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_UltraMachine
The machine is spinning quickly.\pThere's something visible in the\nmachine's core.\pIt looks like an unfamiliar land[.]\nOh! It's gone.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_SafetyTips
SAFETY TIPS WHEN INVESTIGATING\nULTRA SPACE:\p1. Do not interact with anything\nobserved in Ultra Space.\p2. Ensure Beast Killer is on standby,\nin case of emergency.\p3. Always work in pairs, and take\nthorough research notes.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_BeastBallsShelf
There are many peculiar looking\nPok\e Balls lined up on the shelf.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_PC
There are very detailed research\nnotes on the PC.\pBetter leave them alone!

// NPC Houses
#org @gText_DaimynCity_NPCHouses_SuspiciousMan1
We're just minding our own business.\pWhy don't you get lost and play with\nyour Pok\emon or something?

#org @gText_DaimynCity_NPCHouses_SuspiciousMan2
Our house is really basic. There's\nnothing interesting about it or our\llives.

#org @gText_DaimynNPCHouses_TutorConfirmation
I am well studied in Pok\emon moves.\pI can tutor your Pok\emon, say, for\n5 Pok\eChips?\pDo we have a deal?\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])

#org @gText_DaimynNPCHouses_ConfirmationAccepted
Excellent. Pick a move and let's\nbegin.

#org @gText_DaimynNPCHouses_Complete
My lesson is complete. Do return if\nyou would like me to teach\lanother move.

#org @gText_DaimynNPCHouses_TutoringRejected
Understood. If you change your mind,\nI will be here.

#org @gText_DaimynNPCHouses_NotEnoughPokeChips
I need 5 Pok\eChips to cover the\nlesson. Come back when you have\lenough.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TutorsDaughter
Weak moves[.] Strong moves[.]\nThere is no such thing.\pA truly gifted trainer can find a\nuse for any Pok\emon move.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TutorsSon
My daddy teaches moves that no\nother move tutor can!\pYou should learn as many moves from\nhim as you can before you leave\lthe city!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_Intro
Oh, hello there! It's been ages since\nI've been visited by a Pok\emon\lTrainer.\pMost days I spend alone, with my\ntrusty Pikachu.\pIt isn't bad company though,\nhohoho!\pIn ages long past, I wanted to be\nthe very best trainer.\pAnd, after years of hard work, I did\nit!\pBut[.] Time has passed and my battling\nskills aren't what they used to be.\pMy partner, Pikachu, still yearns for\nbattle.\pSay, would you consider taking him\nwith you? He's quite strong.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_Denied
Very well. If you change your mind,\ndo consider coming back.\pI think Pikachu is bored of spending\nhis days cooped up indoors[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_Grateful
How wonderful! I'm sure he will be\nquite ecstatic.\pWhat is your name, perchance?\p[PLAYER]? What a wonderful name.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_NoSpace
Oh dear. I'm grateful to you,\n[PLAYER], but it seems you don't\lhave space in your party.\pCome back when you do, yes?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_PikachuGiven
Pikachu, please go with [PLAYER], and\nshow them what a champion battler\llooks like!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_PikachuObtained
[BLACK]Received [GREEN]Pikachu [BLACK]from the old man!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_PikachuAlreadyGifted
[BLUE]Take good care of Pikachu, okay?\nHe's a champion battler!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_AskingAboutPikachu
[BLUE]Hello again. How are you and Pikachu\ngetting along?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_OffterToTeachVoltTackle
Oh, I just had a great idea!\pPikachu mastered a special move\ncalled Volt Tackle.\pI could teach it to your Pichu,\nPikachu, or Kantonian Raichu.\pWhat do you say?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_ChoosePokemon
Okay, who should I teach?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_TutoringComplete
Okay, all done. They've learned Volt\nTackle now!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_CommentOnMaximizingBond
Remember to treat your Pok\emon\nwell.\pDo that and you can overcome any\nobstacle.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_OldTrainer_Declined
That's fine.\pIf you change your mind, I'd be\nhappy to teach your Pok\emon.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_Pikachu
[BLUE]Chuu.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_PikachuJoins
Pikaaaa!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderBuddy
My friend collects rare Pok\emon from\nall over the region.\pIt'd be worth your time to trade with\nhim and add to your own collection.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderIntro
Hello! I am a world renowned\ntrainer who scours the world in\lsearch of rare Pok\emon.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRejected
That's unfortunate, but I\nunderstand.\pPlease, do return if you find\nyourself with one and change your\lmind.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderWrongPokemon
Oh dear[.] That is not the Pok\emon I\nam looking for.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderTradeInitiated
Great! Let's begin the trade.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestMrMime
I have a [GREEN]Mr. Mime[BLUE] in my possession\nand seek a [GREEN]Galarian Farfetch'd[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestDratini
I have a [GREEN]Dratini[BLUE] in my possession\nand seek a [GREEN]Bonsly[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestCorsola
I have a [GREEN]Galarian Corsola[BLUE] in my\npossession and seek a [GREEN]Slakoth[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestFrillish
I have a [GREEN]Frillish[BLUE] in my\npossession and seek a [GREEN]Magikarp[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestEmolga
I have an [GREEN]Emolga[BLUE] in my\npossession and seek a [GREEN]Boldore[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestEevee
I have an [GREEN]Eevee[BLUE] in my\npossession and seek a [GREEN]Riolu[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestNoibat
I have a [GREEN]Noibat[BLUE] in my\npossession and seek a [GREEN]Lillipup[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderRequestHatenna
I have a [GREEN]Hatenna[BLUE] in my\npossession and seek a [GREEN]Cacnea[BLUE].\pWould you be interested in trading\nwith me?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TraderTradeComplete
Thank you for trading with me.\pI will take good care of your\nPok\emon. Please also do the same.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaIntroduction
Oh, hey! You're a trainer right?\nThat must mean you're using the PC\lsystem, right?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaIntroductionContinued
I built the PC system in Kulure, you\nknow. The name's Lana!\pIn fact, any Pok\emon you catch get\nsent to my PC.\pHehe, don't worry! It's free of\ncharge and totally safe.\pI set the PC system up here with a\ngood buddy's help. He set up the\loriginal PC system in the Kanto\lregion.\pI improved his system and added a\nfew quality of life changes.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaRevisited
Oh hey trainer! Good to see you\nagain.\pYou caught me in the middle of some\ntweaks I've been making to the\lsystem.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaLearnAboutPC
Would you like to learn more about\nthe Kulure PC system?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaUsesPC
Awe, super! That's great to hear.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaDoesNotUsePC
Awe, that's a bummer[.] It's very\nconvenient for trainers.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_DoNotWantToLearnAboutPC
No sweat! Just swing on by if you\nchange your mind. The lab's always\lopen.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_DoWantToLearnAboutPC
Alright, that's what I like to\nhear! You'll really love these\lchanges.\pFor example, you can access up to\n25 boxes now! Handy, right?\pYou can also select multiple Pok\emon\nat once by pressing [SELECT_BUTTON].\pYou'll know it's working if the cursor\nturns yellow.\pThen, click and drag to select\nPok\emon and move them in bulk.\pYou can turn it off again by pressing\n[SELECT_BUTTON]. Easy, right?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_PocketPCHint
I'm working on something else that's\nreally cool, but it's too early to\lshare.\pMaybe I could be convinced, say[.] if\nyou were the Champion?\pHeehee! If you manage to achieve\nthat, come back and I'll show you!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GivingPocketPC1
Oh my!\pWhile I've been tinkering away, you\nwent off and became the Champion!\pCongratulations!\nThat's a huge accomplishment!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GivingPocketPC2
Oh! I've got just the thing.\nHang on a sec, 'kay?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GivingPocketPC3
Hmm[.] Now where did I put it[.]\nAha!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GivingPocketPC4
This is my pride and joy, the\n[GREEN]PortaPC[RED]!\pNow, I know what you're thinking[.]\nAnd yes, you're right!\pThis handy device will allow you to\naccess your PC from anywhere in\lthe world!\pYou can find it in your Tools menu,\nbeside the DexNav. Handy, right?\pPlease, take it! It's a gift from me\nto Kulure's newest Champion.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GivingPocketPC5
[RED]Take good care of that, okay?\nIt's a Lana original!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanaFarewell
Come see me again if you want to\nchat, hey?\pAnd tell your friends about my PC\nsystem!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_LanasPCEntrance
There are many emails sent to and\nfrom other PC System experts.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TransferPC
Some windows are open with text that\nis scrolling by very quickly.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_Poster
It's a complex diagram of a\nprototype called "Cloud System\"

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_TransferMachine
The machine is labelled "Cloud\nTransfer prototype - do not\ltouch!\"

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleterReminderSon
My parents are experts when it comes\nto a Pok\emon's moves.\pMy father is a Move Deleter and can\nhelp your Pok\emon forget moves.\pBut[.] He hasn't seen many customers\nsince HMs could be forgotten.\pMy mother is a Move Reminder. She\ncan teach your Pok\emon any move it\lused to know.\pFor a small fee, she can teach your\nPok\emon Egg Moves.\pPlease spend time with my parents.\nIt'd mean the world to them if\lsomeone had need of their services\lagain.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleterPrompt
Oooh, uh[.] What am I doing? Oh yeah!\nI'm the Move Deleter!\pI can help your Pok\emon forget\nmoves they don't need anymore.\pWould you like to forget a move?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_ChoosePokemon
Which Pok\emon should forget a\nmove?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_ChoiceIsEgg
That's preposterous! An egg cannot\nforget a move; it hasn't learned\lany!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_ChoiceOnlyKnowsOneMove
Oooh! [BUFFER1] only knows one move.\nIf you forget it, you won't be able\lto battle!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_ChooseMove
And which move would you like to\nforget?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_Confirmation
Hmm hmm! You want [BUFFER1] to forget\n[BUFFER2], is that it?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_MoveDeleted
It worked flawlessly! [BUFFER1] has\nforgotten how to use [BUFFER2].

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleter_ComeToForgetMoreMoves
Come see me again, if you want to\nforget more moves.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminderExplanation
Hello, dearie. I am a Pok\emon\ntutor, but I am quite different\lfrom those you may be familiar\lwith.\pYou see, I remind them how to use\nmoves they learn through level\lup, or through their parents.\pFor 1 Pok\eChip, I can teach a move\nthey learn through leveling up.\pFor 10 Pok\eChips, I can teach an\negg move they could have known.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminderRemembersPlayer
Hello, dearie. I remember you.\pSurely you remember me, too, as the\nPok\emon Move Reminder? Ohoho!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminderPrompt
Shall I have one of your Pok\emon\nremember a move? [BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminderPrompt_TeachMore
[RED]It is done.\pWould you like to remember more\nmoves? [BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_LevelUpMovesChoice
Level Up Moves[ALIGN][64][GREEN]1 Pok\eChip

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_EggMovesChoice
Egg Moves[ALIGN][64][GREEN]10 Pok\eChips

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_CancelChoice
Nothing for now

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_NotEnoughChips
I am sorry, but you do not have\nenough Pok\eChips to learn those\lmoves.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_ChoosePokemon
Which Pok\emon would you like me to\nteach?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_ChoseEgg
Oh, bless your heart, sweetie[.]\nI can't teach a move to an egg.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_ChoiceIsIneligible
I am sorry, dearie. That Pok\emon\ncannot learn that type of move.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveReminder_WhichMovePrompt
Which move would you like to teach?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_MoveDeleterReminder_ChangedMind
Come see me again, if you change\nyour mind later.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_AlistairBeatsGrunt
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]Hmph. Child's play.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GruntCommentsOnAlistairsStrength
[BLACK]Grunt: [BLUE]Guh[.] This guy's strong.\nJust who is he?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_AlistairDemandsToEnterBase
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]Now, I won't ask again.\pShow me the entrance to your base,\nor else[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GruntRelents
[BLACK]Grunt: [BLUE]Okay, okay! Just hold on,\nsheesh[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GruntOpensStairs
[BLACK]Grunt: [BLUE]Just have to pull this here,\nand[.] Presto.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GruntInsultsAlistair
[BLACK]Grunt: [BLUE]There, it's open.\nNot like it'll make a difference.\pThe grunts inside are way stronger\nthan me! Gyuh-huh-huh.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_AlistairRetort
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]I'd certainly hope so[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_GruntUpset
[BLACK]Grunt: [BLUE]H-Hey!

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_AlistairNoticesPlayer
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]Ah, [PLAYER].\nImpeccable timing, as always.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_AlistairMentionsWhyHeIsThere
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]I got an anonymous tip that\nTeam Pluto's HQ was hidden here.\pOppressing people through force[.]\nI can't stand Team Pluto.\pIt would be better for everyone if\nthey were to just disappear.\pI simply had to come running to see\nif the tip I received was accurate.\pSure enough, they were right.\p[PLAYER], I assume you're here to put\na stop to Team Pluto too, yes?

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_PlayerHereForPluto
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]Then, let's work together.\nI'll meet you inside.

#org @gText_DaimynCityNPCHouses_PlayerNotHereForPluto
[BLACK]Alistair: [BLUE]I'll accept your presence\nas a fortunate coincidence then.\pI could use your help, [PLAYER].\nMeet me inside, when you are\lready.

#org @gText_DaimynCity_NPCHouses_SuspiciousMan1_AfterAlistair
Tch. Just who was that guy,\nanyways?\pHe made me and my Pok\emon look like\ntotal idiots.

#org @gText_DaimynCity_NPCHouses_SuspiciousMan2_AfterAlistair
It doesn't matter if we let you\nthrough.\pThe grunts in the base will make\nshort work of you.

#org @gText_DaimynCity_NPCHouses_PlutoHousePlant
It's a normal looking plant.

#org @gText_DaimynCity_NPCHouses_PlutoHousePlant_AfterAlistair
Oh! This plant is placed over a\nsecret switch.

// Gym
#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceLaughs
[BLUE]Wahaha! Those are big winnings,\nbaby!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceSpotsPlayer
[BLUE]Oh. What do I spy but a fresh\nface? Hello there!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceAddressesMalePlayer
[BLUE]Tell me, laddie[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceAddressesFemalePlayer
[BLUE]Tell me, lassie[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceAsksPlayersIntention
[BLUE]Are you here to challenge the gym\nleader, or play the slots?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChoiceGym
The gym

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChoiceSlots
The slots

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChoiceNeither
Neither

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_PlayerChoseGym
[BLUE]Wahahaha! A challenger, are ye?\nExcellent! I'm sure Chance will be\lpleased.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_PlayerChoseSlots
[BLUE]Wahahaha! Well, you certainly won't\nbe left wanting, in a place like\lthis!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_PlayerChoseNeither
[BLUE]Wahahaha! Keeping your cards close\nto your chest, eh? I respect that!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceLeadsPlayerToDeskMan
[BLUE]Well, no matter your reason for\ncoming here, you'll need a Coin\lCase.\pCome with me. I'm friends with the\nowner and can hook you up!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceAsksForCoins
[BLUE]Hey, my good man! My new friend\nhere would like to spend some time\lat this fine establishment.\pCan you get them set up with a Coin\nCase?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManResponds
[BLUE]Why, of course, good sir.\pHere, please accept this Coin Case.\nIt will hold the coins you can use\lat this establishment.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceRespondsToDeskMan
[BLUE]Yer a real champ, mate.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceExplainsTheGymRules
[BLUE]If yer here to play the slots, then\nyou have everything you need.\pIf yer here for Gym Leader Chance's\nbadge, though, there are some\lrules you'd best keep in mind[.]\pChance only challenges those that\ncan prove they're saavy gamblers\land can amass a small fortune.\pHow do you do that? Well, there are\n3 ways[.]\p1. Make Your Own Luck - This means\nbuying them from my pal here with\lyour hard earned cash.\p2. Getting Lucky - With a little\nluck, you can win more coins from\lthe slots here. Rumor has it some\lmachines are luckier than others.\p3. Playing the Field - It may not\nlook it, but most people here are\lgym trainers. If you beat them in\lbattle, they'll give you some\lcoins.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_ChanceTakesHisLeave
[BLUE]My, my, look at the time! I gotta\njet. T'was a pleasure, my friend.\pI'm sure we'll see each other around\nreal soon.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManGives500Coins
[BLUE]Ahem[.] My friend did not explain a\nfew things. Please allow me.\pAt this establishment, fun is\nforemost.\pAs a result, we give all new members\n500 coins, on the house.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManCoinsHandedOver
[BLUE]Here, you may store these in your\nCoin Case.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManExplainsCoins
[BLUE]Furthermore, you may be wondering\nhow coins work at this\lestablishment. Allow me to\lelaborate.\pCoins may be purchased from me for\n\$10 each.\pIf you have run out completely and\ncannot afford more, I will give you\l10, on the house.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManExplainsPrizes
[BLUE]To your left, you will find our prize\ncorner. You may exchange your\lcoins there for exciting prizes.\pThese prizes include rare Pok\emon,\nas well as hard to find items.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManExplainsPrizesAreLockedByGymLeader
[BLUE]As with all things in life, there is a\ncatch.\pYou cannot purchase prizes until you\nhave overcome this gym's leader in\lbattle.\pI trust this will incentivize you to\nprove your prowess in battle, yes?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManExplainsCoinMachine
[BLUE]To challenge the gym leader, you\nwill need to deposit 2,000 coins\linto the machine beside the\lbarrier. Only then will it lower.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Cutscene_DeskManConcludesExplaination
[BLUE]Now then, I have talked long\nenough.\pPlease, enjoy our fine establishment\nto the fullest!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_Welcome
Welcome to the Daimyn City Game\nCorner! I sell coins for \$10 each.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_CoinCaseFull
My apologies, but your Coin Case is\nfull. You can't hold any more!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_BuyCoinsPrompt
Would you like to buy some?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_CoinCountPrompt
Very good. How many would you like\nto buy?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_ChoseTooManyCoins
Oh dear[.] Your Coin Case can't hold\nthat many coins.\pIt can hold [BUFFER1] more. Would you\nlike to buy that many?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_CoinPurchaseConfirmation
[BUFFER1] coins will cost \$[BUFFER2]. Is\nthat okay?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_NotEnoughMoney
You don't have enough money[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_NoMoney
What's that? You don't have enough\nmoney to buy any coins?\pHere, I'll give you 10 on the house.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_PurchaseComplete
Excellent! Thank you for your\npatronage.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinSeller_Farewell
We hope you enjoy your time at the\nDaimyn City Game Corner.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_ExpertTips
Yo, superstar! Good to see you in\nthe capital city.\pThis place doubles as both a gym\nand a game corner. Isn't that\lsomething?\pThe leader, Chance, likes to play\nthe field, both in games of chance\land in Pok\emon battles.\pHe'll use moves that keep his\nmomentum flowing.\pAs a result, you'll often find he\ngives himself the upper hand with\lan advantageous switch up during\lbattle.\pAll that to say, battle smartly and\nprepare to suddenly be put on the\lback foot and you'll be A-okay.\pYou got this, superstar.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_ExpertBadgeObtained
Superstar! I knew you could pull\nthrough.\pAll of Chance's tricks were no match\nfor you, were they?\pCongratulations on your victory.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader
Welcome to the Game Corner Exchange\nCounter.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_DoNotHaveBadge
Oh! I'm sorry. You must have this\ngym's badge before you can\lexchange at this counter.\pPlease return after receiving the\nRoundabout Badge.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_OpenShopPrompt
What can I get for you?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_Confirmation
You want [BUFFER1]? That will cost\nyou [BUFFER2] coins.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_NotEnoughCoins
You don't have enough coins for that\nprize.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_PurchaseComplete
One [BUFFER1], coming right up!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_ShopClosed
Come back and exchange more coins\nfor more fabulous prizes!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GenericTrader_Declined
I hope you have a pleasant day.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokemonTrader
At this counter, I can exchange your\ncoins for rare Pok\emon.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokemonTrader_ReceivedPokemon
[BLACK]Received [BUFFER1]![BLUE]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokemonTrader_AddedToParty
I've added [BUFFER1] to your party.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokemonTrader_AddedToBox
Your party is full, so I've sent\n[BUFFER1] to your box.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_ItemTrader
At this counter, I can exchange your\ncoins for rare items.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_TrainerCoinPayout
For defeating me, I'll give you\n[BUFFER1] coins.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_TrainerCoinsGiven
Good luck, trainer!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_YoungsterJacob_Intro
Hehehe[.] This strategy'll knock you\nflat!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_YoungsterJacob_Defeat
Wha-? I executed my strategy\nflawlessly!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_YoungsterJacob_Chat
That strategy doesn't always work,\nbut when it does, it's so much fun!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokefanKanesha_Intro
Don't underestimate my Pok\emon[.]\nIt looks weak but can become quite\lstrong!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokefanKanesha_Defeat
Well, what'd you think?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_PokefanKanesha_Chat
Power Trick can make Shuckle really\npowerful! But[.] As a result, it's\ldefense gets much worse.\pIt requires some careful planning to\nmake the most of.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BeautyEmilie_Intro
Tee hee! Careful; looks can be\ndeceiving!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BeautyEmilie_Defeat
Were you fooled?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BeautyEmilie_Chat
The Illusion ability can be used to\ntrick your opponent into making\ldecisions off of incorrect info.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BeautyLeanne_Intro
My team is like a box of chocolates:\nYou'll never know what you'll get!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BeautyLeanne_Defeat
Ahahaha, I couldn't have predicted\nthat!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BeautyLeanne_Chat
Metronome is so unpredictable. You\ncould get very lucky, or very\lunlucky.\pNot knowing is half the fun though!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_ChannelerRosita_Intro
My Pok\emon can turn the tides of\nbattle in an instant. Watch out!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_ChannelerRosita_Defeat
We couldn't shift the tide after all[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_ChannelerRosita_Chat
Some powerful Pok\emon are slow, but\nTrick Room can turn that around.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GamblerChuck_Intro
My team takes their own strengths and\nmakes them even greater. Can you\lhandle it?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GamblerChuck_Defeat
Perhaps your team had it's own\nstrengths, too.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_GamblerChuck_Chat
Some moves are strengthened based\non the stat difference between\lopponents.\pMy team takes advantage of a high\nspeed stat and elevates it to make\lcertain moves even stronger!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BurglarDexter_Intro
Ehehehe! Now that our eyes have\nmet, you'll be trapped in a battle\lagainst me. Got you!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BurglarDexter_Defeat
Wh-? How did you wriggle free?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BurglarDexter_Chat
Certain moves and abilities can trap\nyour opponent.\pWhen used right, it can set you up\nfor a very easy victory.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCWoman
If I win big, I'm going to put all my\nearnings into a big vacation.\pI guess you could say I'm investing\nin hope.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCPsychic
Hmmm[.] Yes! I predict this is the\nluckiest slot in the building.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCPsychicFollowUp
Hey, it's rude to eavesdrop.\pJust for that, you can't have this\nmachine.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCOldMan
Agh[.] Lost again[.]\pI guess it just goes to show, you\nlose more than you win.\pIn life and the slots[.] Sigh[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCRocker
Rock on! All 7's! I'm on a roll.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCBlackBelt
I pulled the lever too hard and now\nit squeaks.\pAhaha! Please don't tell the owner\nabout this.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_NPCGentleman
My granddaughter has wanted a\nDratini for ages.\pBy golly, I'm going to win enough\ncoins to get it for her!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_AmuletCoinGuy
Ugh[.] I lost my Amulet Coin around\nhere somewhere.\pI think I last had it somewhere\naround the prize counter.\pI was going to give it to my Pok\emon\nto hold and strike it rich, too.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_Winners
Daimyn City Gym\nVictors: Casey

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_WinnersWithBadge
Daimyn City Gym\nVictors: Casey, [PLAYER]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_WinnersWithBadgeAndRival
Daimyn City Gym\nVictors: Casey, [PLAYER], [RIVAL]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_SlotMachinePrompt
It's a slot machine! Want to play?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_SlotMachineDeclined
Maybe later.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_DebtPaid
Bzzt! The barrier's toll has been\npaid, and you may freely pass.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_DebtRemainingAndPrompt
Bzzt! You must pay the toll in order\nto access the gym leader.\pYour account has a balance of\n[BUFFER1] coins remaining.\pHow many coins would you like to\ndeposit?

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_NotEnougCoins
Bzzt! You do not have that many\ncoins.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_TooManyCoins
Bzzt! That is too many coins.\nReceiving just the required\l[BUFFER1] coins[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_Processing
Bzzt! Processing[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_DebtRemaining
Bzzt! Your remaining balance is\n[BUFFER1] coins.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_CoinDepositBox_DebtFullyPaidOff
Bzzt! You have fully paid the toll.\nThe way to the gym leader is open.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_Talk
[BLUE]Wahaha! I just knew we'd see each\nother again before long.\pThat's right! I am this gym's leader.\nThe name's Chance.\pForgive me for not introducing\nmyself earlier.\pA gambling man never reveals his full\nhand, you see.\pI knew from the moment I laid eyes\non you that you had what it took\lto complete my challenge.\pBut you didn't come all this way just\nfor me to talk your ear off, yeah?\pYou're here for the badge, and to\nearn it, you'll need to beat me in\lbattle.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_Intro
[BLUE]Alright, let's see if you're the real\ndeal, or just bluffing[.] Game on!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_Defeat
That's the game! A real gambler\nknows when to fold with dignity.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_BadgeAwarded
[BLUE]You're the real deal, kiddo. You've\nearned this fair and square.\pTake it; the Roundabout Badge.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_BadgeReceived
[PLAYER] received the Roundabout\nBadge!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_BadgeDescription
[BLUE]That badge is proof of your skills.\pIt will also allow you to use the\nmove Fly outside of battle.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_TMReceived
[BLUE]Please take these TMs as well.\pI'm sure you'll be able to use them\nto keep your opponents on their\ltoes.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_TMReceived
[PLAYER] received TM72, TM89, and\nTM94 from Chance!

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_CoinsReturned
[BLUE]Now, I ain't a stickler. You earned\nyour coins fair and square.\pHere, you may have the 2,000 coins\nyou invested into my gym challenge.

#org @gText_DaimynCityGym_LeaderChance_Chat
[BLUE]You're planning to go all the way to\nthe top, aren'tcha?\pI'll be keeping my eye on you, kid.

#org @gText_DaimynGym_LeaderChance_AskForRematch
[BLUE][PLAYER]! I heard you went all the\nway and became the Champion!\pHearing that got me real fired up.\nI've been itching for a battle!\pWhat do you say?

#org @gText_DaimynGym_LeaderChance_PreBattle
[BLUE]Wahahaha! The die has been cast!\nPay close attention, [PLAYER]!\pThe team I choose is sure to mystify\nyou.

#org @gText_DaimynGym_LeaderChance_OnPlayerVictory
Bravo, bravo!

#org @gText_DaimynGym_LeaderChance_ChoseNotToBattle
[BLUE]What a shame!\pYou know when to fold them though,\nand I'll respect that decision.

#org @gText_DaimynGym_LeaderChance_BeatenToday
[BLUE]You're something else, kiddo!\nTell ya what.\pCome back tomorrow, and we can have\nourselves another battle.

// Mall
#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawIntro
Welcome to the Pok\emon Lottery, or\nPok\eLotto for short!\pEvery day, we draw a random\nPok\emon.\pIf you've seen that Pok\emon, you win\na Pearl! If you've caught it, you\lwin a Big Pearl!\pSounds fun, doesn't it? There's\nno entry fee, either.\pWould you like to play?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawStarting
Great! Let's draw the lucky Pok\emon[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawPokemonChosen
Today's lucky Pok\emon is [BUFFER1].\nPlease let me see your Pok\edex.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawChoseNo
But[.] It's free. No problem! If you\nchange your mind, just come see\lme!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawLost
I'm sorry, you have not caught or\nseen a [BUFFER1]. You didn't win.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawWinSeen
You have seen a [BUFFER1].\pYou've earned our second place\nprize.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawWinCaught
You have caught a [BUFFER1]!\pYou've earned our first place prize!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LuckyDrawComeAgainTomorrow
Thank you for playing, please come\nagain tomorrow.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_Greeter
Welcome to the Daimyn City Mall!\nShop to your heart's content!\pPlease see the store directory\nbeside me if you'd like assistance.\pWe hope you enjoy your time with us!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_HerbSeller
[BLACK]Ehehehe[.] My herbs heal your Pok\emon\ngreatly[.] If they can handle them!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealOfTheDayOffer
Hello! I sell other stores'\noverstock for a reduced price.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealOfTheDayPurchasing
Thank you! Here you go!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealOfTheDayBought
Thanks! Come back tomorrow for more\nhot deals. And tell your friends!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealOfTheDayAlreadyBought
Sorry, friend. I've sold out for the\nday. Come back tomorrow, m'kay?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealOfTheDayChoseNo
Alright, I'll be here if you change\nyour mind.\pJust remember, the deal expires at\nthe end of the day!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealOfTheDayNotEnoughMoney
Sorry, but you don't have enough\nmoney! Come back when you do.\pJust remember to do it before the\ndeal expires at the end of the\lday!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealPremierBalls
Today's deal is [GREEN]5 Premier Balls for\n\$500[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealSuperPotions
Today's deal is [GREEN]3 Super Potions for\n\$1500[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealBerries
Today's deal is [GREEN]a berry pack for\n\$1000[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealSeeds
Today's deal is [GREEN]a seed pack for\n\$800[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealUltraBalls
Today's deal is [GREEN]3 Ultra Balls for\n\$3000[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealHyperPotions
Today's deal is [GREEN]2 Hyper Potions for\n\$2500[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealStatusHealers
Today's deal is [GREEN]status healers for\n\$1200[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealXItems
Today's deal is [GREEN]a pack of X Items\nfor \$2000[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealHerbs
Today's deal is [GREEN]a pack of herbs\nfor \$1500[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealGreatBalls
Today's deal is [GREEN]4 great balls\nfor \$1250[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealGems
Today's deal is [GREEN]a pack of gems\nfor \$5000[BLUE]. Are you interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DealEvolutionaryStones
Today's deal is [GREEN]a pack of evolution\nstones for \$6000[BLUE]. Are you\linterested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_MagazineSeller
Hello! I sell magazines. Can I\ninterest you in one? No?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_PokeballSeller
[BLACK]Rare Pok\e Balls! Come get your Rare\nPok\e Balls here!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_XItemsSeller
[BLACK]I sell items that will give your\nPok\emon a serious edge. Buy some!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_GarageSaleMan
The mall rents out stalls to people\nfor a small fee.\pIt's great for people like me, who're\nhoping to sell some of their\lold things.\pSay[.] You wouldn't be in the market\nfor some old tech, would you?\pNo? Okay then.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_TMSeller
[BLACK]Want to teach your Pok\emon new\nmoves? Then you need my TMs!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_SeedSeller
[BLACK]I've got Terrain Seeds, straight from\nHeleo Ranch! You'll love 'em!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_EVReducingBerriesSeller
[BLACK]My berries lower your Pok\emon's EVs,\nbut make them friendly! Want some?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_VitaminsSeller
[BLACK]Your Pok\emon are looking weak[.] Buff\nthem up!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_GemsSeller
[BLACK]I sell rare gems that will strengthen\nyour Pok\emon's moves. Interested?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_TypeBoostingItemsSeller
[BLACK]Could I interest you in trinkets that\nboost your Pok\emon's typed moves?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_RareCollectiblesMan
I'm selling rare trinkets and\nbaubles you can't find elsewhere.\pI don't think you'll have enough\nmoney for them. Ehehehe.\pWindow shopping is free, I guess.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_Question
Hey, trainer! I'm selling a rare and\npowerful fish Pok\emon.\pYou want it, yes? \$2,000, only for\nyou!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_SaidNo
Feh, your loss! It'll go to some\nother kid and you'll miss out.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_NotEnoughMoney
Hey, what gives? You don't have\nenough cash! Come back when you\ldo.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_NoRoomInParty
Wise kid! [.] But you don't have any\nroom. Come back when you do.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_BoughtCarvanhaFanfare
[BLACK]Bought a Carvanha!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_BoughtCarvanha
[BLUE]Wise kid! I'm sure the two of you\nwill have a great time or whatever.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_FishSeller_CarvanhaAlreadyBought
How's that fish treating you? Good?\nYeah, great[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_IncenseSeller
[BLACK](Sniff) Do you smell that? My\nincenses are so wonderful.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_TypeWeaknessBerriesSeller
[BLACK]Want to dull the sting of super\neffective moves? Then I'm your gal!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_Fisherman
I heard someone was selling a rare\nfish Pok\emon around here, but I\lcan't find him.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_OldLady
There's nothing like a little bit of\nshopping to soothe the soul.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_LostPearlsWoman
I lost my Pearl around here\nsomewhere[.]\pIf I just retrace my steps, I'll find\nit eventually.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_UndecidedGirl
Hmm[.] Should I buy one of those, or\none of those?\pOooh! I just can't decide! Maybe I\nshould just get both.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_Camper
I'm stocking up before I go out\ncamping. You should do the same!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_Blackbelt
They sell a lot of great things here\nthat make your Pok\emon stronger.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_BugCatcher
I keep getting poisoned when I find\nBug type Pok\emon.\pMaybe I should buy some Antidotes.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DateBoy
Wh-what should I say to her? I\ndidn't even think she'd say yes to\lcoming on this date!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_DateGirl
This cool guy asked me out on a\ndate at the mall! We're having so\lmuch fun!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_TiredOldMan
I'm so tired[.] Why does this mall\nhave to be so big?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_WaitingGirl
I'm waiting for my friends to get\nhere so we can go shopping!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_EvolutionStonesSeller
[BLACK]I offer rare stones excavated from\nCarnelidge Volcano. Want to see?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_HeldItemSeller
[BLACK]My items help your Pok\emon in\nbattle. You'll need these to win!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_Rocker
Whoa, no way! They're having a big\nsale today! Rock on!!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_TallTV
It's a big square TV like the one\nGrandpa has! It looks heavy.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_RetroGame
It's a retro game console with all\nthe classic games. Looks fun!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_CampingTV
It's a portable TV meant for camping.\nDad might like this[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_PhonePrompt
It's a phone!\p[.]\pIt's been a while[.] Call mom?

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_ChoseToCallMom
Yeah, let's call mom[.]

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_Mom
[RED]Hello?\pOh, [PLAYER], is that you?\nIt's so nice to hear from you!\pHow has your journey been? Are you\nand [RIVAL] doing well?\pYou're in Daimyn City? Wow! That's so\nfar from home!\pYou and your Pok\emon must've\ntravelled so far together.\pYou're travelling with [BUFFER1] right\nnow? How wonderful!\pYou'll have to tell me all about\nyour journey and the things you've\lseen when you get home.\pIt sounds like you're having so much\nfun! I'm so happy for you,\l[PLAYER].\pDo your best out there, okay\n[PLAYER]?\pAnd please remember, you can come\nhome any time you need to.\pAlright, [PLAYER], I'll let you get\nback to it. I'll be rooting for you!\pBye bye, sweetie!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_PlayerFeelsBetter
Mom's rooting for me! Time to get out\nthere and make her proud.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_ChoseNotToCallMom
Maybe later.

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_ChancePoster
Challenge Chance, the High Roller,\nat Daimyn City gym today!

#org @gText_DaimynCityMall_StoreDirectory
Store directory:\pHealing Consumables: SW Corner\nTMs: NW Corner\lBerries: N Hall\lStat Boosters: NE Corner\lDeal of the Day: SE Corner\lEvolution Stones: S Hall

// Ascension Tower
#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_Introduction
Welcome to Ascension Tower! I accept\nregistrations for the Elite Four\lChallenge.\pWould you like to take the Elite\nFour Challenge?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_Introduction_PlayerIsChampion
It is good to see you again,\nChampion [PLAYER].\pYou have a challenger waiting for\nyou.\pWould you like to take the Elite\nFour challenge, and face them at\lthe end?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_NoChampionsFlag
Please present your Victory Flag\nand I'll get you registered[.]\pOh! You don't have one.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_NoChampionsFlag_HasNotEarnedRightToEnterVictoryRoad
You'll first need to gather all 8\nbadges, and return here to register\lfor the Victory Road Challenge.\pThen, you may ascend Victory Road\nto claim a Victory Flag of your\lown.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_NoChampionsFlag_HasEarnedRightToEnterVictoryRoad
You must ascend Victory Road to\nclaim a Victory Flag of your own.\pAfterward, I'll be happy to register\nyou for the Elite Four Challenge.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_ChallengeInfo
Trainers who have obtained a\nVictory Flag may challenge the\lElite Four Challenge.\pApplicants must battle four of the\nKulure region's best trainers in a\lback-to-back gauntlet.\pIf successful, they will obtain the\nright to challenge the Champion for\ltheir title!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_GettingTheGate
Wonderful! I'll just put your\nname into the system[.]\pPerfect. Thank you for registering,\n[PLAYER].\pPlease, allow me to get the gate for\nyou.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_GettingTheGate_PlayerIsChampion
Wonderful! Please, allow me to get\nthe gate for you.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_WishingLuck
You may proceed to the elevator at\nthe back of the room.\pIt will take you to your first\nchallenge.\pShould you succeed, you may return\nto the elevator to be\ldelievered to your next challenge.\pOn behalf of everyone at Ascension\nTower, I wish you the best of\lluck!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_BattleTowerAttendant_GatheringFunding
Welcome to Ascension Tower!\pI would normally be accepting\nregistrations for the Battle\lFrontier.\pWe're currently undergoing some\nmaintenance, however[.]\pWe can hopefully offer this service\nsomeday soon.\pUntil then, please continue to train\nyour Pok\emon and strive to be the\lbest you can be.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_BattleTowerAttendant_Introduction
Welcome to Ascension Tower! I accept\nregistrations for the Battle Tower\lChallenge.\pWould you like to take the Battle\nTower Challenge?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourAttendant_BattleTowerInfo
Trainers who have become Gym\nLeaders, Elite Four members, or\lthe Champion are eligible to\lpartake in the Battle Tower\lChallenge.\pThese trainers may choose 3 Pok\emon\nwith which they will battle as many\ltrainers as possible.\pUpon losing, they will be awarded\nbattle points (BP) based on their\lperformance.\pBP can be traded for exciting prizes\nthat can't be found elsewhere.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_BattleTowerAttendant_NotChampion
Oh, my apologies. You must be a Gym\nLeader, Elite Four member, or the\lChampion to partake in this\lchallenge.\pPlease see me again if you attain\nany of these titles.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_AttendantChoseNo
Understood. Please speak to me again\nif you change your mind.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_KarateMan
Wrrrrooooaaaggghhh!\pI almost beat Lucas this time!\pI'll train up and wipe that smug grin\noff his face, just you wait and\lsee.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_Girl
I like coming here to watch the\nElite Four challengers battle!\pEveryone gives it their all, and it\nleads to really exciting battles.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_BigMan
My son dreams of becoming the\nChampion. It's all he talks about.\pI thought I'd come here to see what\nit's all about.\pThis Champion is seriously strong! I'd\nbetter help him train so he can do\lhis best.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_RecordsSign
It's a board showing the records\nof all the trainers who've\lchallenged the Elite Four.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_RecordsSign_ChampionTitleDefenses
I've defended my Champion title\n[BUFFER1] times!\pI wonder if I can set a record?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_RecordsSign_NotOnBoard
Maybe someday I'll be on here!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalGreetsPlayer
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Oh, hey [PLAYER]!\nYou're just in time.\pLet's register ourselves for the Elite\nFour Challenge!\pOnce we battle and beat them,\nwe'll have our chance to battle\lChampion Selene[.]\pI can't wait! We've dreamed of this\nday for ages!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalAsksToRegister
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Excuse me.\pMy friend [PLAYER] and I would like\nto register for the Elite Four\lChallenge.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_AttendantAsksToSeeChampionsFlag
[BLACK]Attendant: [RED]I can help you with\nthat!\pMay I please see your Victory\nFlags?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalConfusedAboutFlag
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Um[.] My Victory Flag?\pI've never heard of that[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_AttendantExplainsVictoryRoadChallenge
[BLACK]Attendant: [RED]Oh, my apologies.\pOnly trainers who have claimed a\nVictory Flag from Victory\lRoad may challenge the Elite Four.\pI can register you as entrants to\nVictory Road, if you've collected\lall of Kulure's gym badges.\pWould you like to sign up for the\nVictory Road Challenge instead?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalAsksToTakeVictoryRoadChallenge
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Oh, yes please!\nWe have all our badges.\pWe really want to challenge the\nElite Four and Champion.\pCould you please register us for\nthe Victory Road Challenge?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_AttendantAsksToSeeBadges
[BLACK]Attendant: [RED]Absolutely!\pPlease state your names and present\nyour badges.\pThen, a member of the Elite Four\nwill come down to meet you.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalPresentsBadges
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Awesome!\pI'm [RIVAL]. Here are my badges.\pThis here is [PLAYER].

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_PlayerPresentsBadges
[BLACK][PLAYER] presented their gym badges.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_AttendantCongratulatesPlayerAndRival
[BLACK]Attendant: [RED]Allow me to congratulate\nyou on your accomplishment!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_AttendantCallsForEliteFourMember
[BLACK]Attendant: [RED]Please wait just a\nmoment.\pA member of the Elite Four will be\nhere shortly to see you.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalWaitingForEliteFourMember
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]This is so exciting!\pI wonder which Elite Four member\nwe'll end up meeting?\pOh, I can't wait[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_SeleneGreetsPlayerAndRival
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Hey, you two!\nIt's been a while, hasn't it?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalGreetingSelene
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Champion Selene?\nWhat are you doing here?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_SeleneExplainsHerself
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]We got word that you two\nwere registering for the Victory\lRoad Challenge.\pLucas was going to come down to\nexplain things to you, but[.] Well[.]\pWhen I heard it was you two, I just\nhad to come see you myself!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalUnderstands
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Oh, yeah. That makes\nsense!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_SeleneExplainsVictoryRoadChallenge
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]First, please accept my\ncongratulations on receiving all 8\lgym badges!\pWith those badges in hand, you can\nnow take the Victory Road\lChallenge.\pThe challenge itself is simple.\nAllow me to explain how it works[.]\pYou must ascend Victory Road, a\nmountain on the western isle.\pVictory Road is filled with\npowerful Pok\emon and trainers.\pIt's no stretch to say they're among\nthe best of the best!\pAt the peak of the mountain, you will\nfind a Victory Flag.\pYou must return with that flag in\norder to challenge the Elite Four,\las well as myself.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_SeleneExplainsEliteFourChallenge
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Next, I'll explain\nthe Elite Four Challenge.\pYou will be tasked with battling each\nmember of the Elite Four in order.\pAfterward, you may challenge me for\nthe title of Kulure's Champion.\pOnce the challenge starts, you will\nbe unable to stop until you have\lsucceeded or failed.\pDon't sweat it if you lose,\nthough!\pThis challenge can be attempted any\ntime and as many times as you'd\llike, as long as you still have the\lVictory Flag.\pDo you have any questions?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalHasNoQuestions
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Nope, all good here!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_SeleneBidsPlayerAndRivalFarewell
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Okay, great!\pIf you need a refresher later, just\nspeak with the attendant here.\pAnd[.] That's all I had to share!\pI'm sure you're both really excited\nto take the Victory Road\lChallenge.\pI won't keep you here any longer.\pGood luck! I'll be looking forward to\nbattling with you.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalIsReady
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]You bet!\pWe'll get those flags and be back\nbefore you know it.\pI can't wait to finally battle with\nyou, Champion Selene!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_SeleneLeaves
[BLACK]Selene: [RED]Haha, I bet!\nWell, goodbye for now!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFourChallengeRegistration_RivalRecapsTheChallenges
[BLACK][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Okay, so[.]\pFirst we go to Victory Road and get\nthe Victory Flag at the peak.\pThen, we come back here and\nchallenge the Elite Four and\lChampion Selene.\pOkay!\p[PLAYER], I'm going to go toughen up\nmy Pok\emon. Then, I'll get that\lflag[.]\pI'm sure we'll cross paths on Victory\nRoad.\pIf we do, you'd better be ready!\pMy Pok\emon and I will give it our\nall!\pOkay, [PLAYER], I'd better get\ngoing. See you around!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_FirstFloor
[BLUE]Greetings, and welcome to the Elite\nFour Challenge.\pMy name is Yael, and I shall be your\nattendant today.\pNow please, relax while I deliver\nyou to the first Elite Four member,\lHannah.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_FirstFloor_PerformingRematch
[BLUE]Ah, Champion [PLAYER].\nIt is good to see you again.\pI assume you are here to defend\nyour title?\pYou will be required to beat each\nElite Four member once again.\pI do believe they will be eager to\nsee you, however.\pWithout further ado, allow me to\ndeliver you to Hannah[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_SecondFloor
[BLUE]Welcome back. I see you have\novercome Hannah.\pThen please, allow me to deliver you\nto your next opponent, Lucas.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_ThirdFloor
[BLUE]Congratulations are in order. You\nhave beaten Lucas.\pIt is now my pleasure to deliver you\nto Jenna, your next opponent.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_FourthFloor
[BLUE]Masterfully done.\pWith Jenna's defeat, it is my duty to\ndeliver you to the final Elite Four\lmember, Thomas.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_ChampionsFloor
[BLUE]Please accept my congratulations!\pYou have overcome every Elite Four\nmember.\pThen, there is nothing left for me to\ndo but deliver you to the\lChampion's quarters.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_WishesLuck
[BLUE]We have arrived at your\ndestination.\pBest of luck in your challenge, yes?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_PriorToChampion
[BLUE]Please ensure you are fully prepared\nbefore exiting the elevator.\pI'm certain the Champion will be\neager to battle you without delay.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_PriorToChampion_PlayerIsChampion
[BLUE]Please ensure you are fully prepared\nbefore exiting the elevator.\pIt is my duty to send your\nchallenger to you posthaste.\pYou will not have another\nopportunity to prepare.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ElevatorAttendant_Chat
Please, step out of the elevator\nwhen you are prepared.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_HannahIntro
[RED]Hello, and welcome to the Pok\emon\nLeague!\pOnly the best of the best can reach\nthis place.\pI am Hannah, and I will be your\nfirst opponent.\pBut[.] Don't assume I'll be easy to\nbeat just because I'm first!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_HannahDefeat
Very good!\nYou have earned this victory.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_HannahChat
[RED]Congratulations!\pYou and your Pok\emon battled\nadmirably.\pYou may proceed to your next\nopponent by returning to the\lelevator.\pGood luck!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_LucasIntro
[BLUE]Yaaaaawwwwnnnn[.]\pI heard my break was over because a\nnew challenger showed up.\pNever expected it'd be some kid.\pLook[.] Don't cry when you lose,\nokay?\pI'm just doing my job[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_LucasDefeat
Whew, you took that battle seriously!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_LucasChat
[BLUE]Alright, so you've got the stuff\nafter all.\pWin or lose, it doesn't matter.\nI did my job, so we're all good.\pHead on back to the elevator when\nyou're ready.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_JennaIntro
[RED]Hey, hey, hey! We've got a new\nchallenger in the house, folks!\pI'm Jenna, the third Elite Four\nmember.\pLookie here - these battles are some\nof the fiercest in the region.\pSo, it only makes sense that we give\nit our all and rock out!\pC'mon now, let's jam!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_JennaDefeat
Rock on!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_JennaChat
[RED]Now THAT was an electric battle!\nYou rock, kiddo!\pI hope you keep that rhythm going!\pAlright, time for me to take a bow.\pHead back to the elevator when\nyou're ready for your next battle.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_ThomasIntro
[BLUE]I received word that an up-and-\ncoming trainer was challenging us.\pTo be honest, I expected someone\nmore[.] Impressive.\pListen here.\pI am the final Elite Four\nmember before Miss Selene.\pI will not allow you to waste her\ntime. Your challenge ends here.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_ThomasDefeat
W-what? This is unprecedented[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_ThomasChat
[BLUE]I must admit, I am surprised.\pWhether it was luck or skill, it\nmatters not.\pYou won, and you have earned the\nright to challenge Miss Selene.\pYou may return to the elevator when\nyou are ready to challenge her.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_PreBattle1
[RED][PLAYER], you've finally arrived.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_PreBattle2
[RED]You know, when we first met, I had a\nfeeling you'd stand before me\lsomeday.\pTo think you've become so capable in\nsuch a short time[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_PreBattle3
[RED][PLAYER], are you ready?\pYou stand before the Undefeated\nChampion, Selene.\pThe whole region is watching us right\nnow.\pI will face you with everything I've\ngot, and I ask the same of you.\pI should warn you[.]\pI didn't get to where I am today by\nluck.\pDo you think you can overcome me,\nwhen victory itself stands with me?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_Defeat
[PLAYER], you and your Pok\emon\nhave battled incredibly well.\pIt is my pleasure to award you the\ntitle of Kulure's Newest Champion!\pPlease, accept my heartfelt\ncongratulations.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_PostBattle
[RED][PLAYER], what you've accomplished\ntoday cannot be understated.\pYou and your Pok\emon have risen\nabove every challenge you faced.\pThrough the trust and bond you\nshare, you accomplished something\lmany have only dreamed of.\pAnd[.] You have fought to protect\nthe region we all call home.\pThere is no one more deserving of\nthe title of Champion.\pNow, please, come with me to the\nHall of Fame.\pI'd like to make a record of what\nyou and your Pok\emon have\lachieved.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_ExplainingHallOfFame
[RED][PLAYER], we are standing in the Hall\nof Fame.\pIt is a sacred place that only\nChampions may enter.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_UrgingPlayerToEnterHallOfFame
[RED]This machine will make a record of\nyou and your Pok\emon partners.\pIt will stand as a testiment to\neverything you have accomplished.\p[PLAYER], please place your Pok\e\nBalls into the machine when you\lare ready.\pI will then officially welcome you\nto the Kulure Hall of Fame!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_ChampionSelene_ReturningToAnthra
[RED]Undoubtedly, your friends and family\nhave already seen your victory.\pI'm sure you're eager to return home\nto celebrate with them.\pAs for myself, I think it's time for a\nnice, long vacation[.]\pBut that can wait.\pCome! Let us return to Anthra Town\nto celebrate your accomplishments.

// Rematches and Title Defense
#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_HannahRematchIntro
[RED]I wasn't expecting a visit from\nChampion [PLAYER] today!\pYou are here to train your\nPok\emon, I assume?\pVery well, I accept your\nchallenge.\pBut, you should know that I've been\ntraining, too!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_HannahRematchDefeat
That concludes our battle!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_HannahRematchChat
[RED]Champion [PLAYER], you battled quite\nexceptionally.\pYou may challenge Lucas next.\pDo come visit again sometime, okay?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_LucasRematchIntro
[BLUE]Oh, hey. It's Champion [PLAYER].\pDoes this mean this is a friendly\nvisit, or a challenge?\pHaha, I'm just kidding.\nI know why you're here.\pLet's get started then; my break\nstarts soon.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_LucasRematchDefeat
Yup, that went exactly how I\nthought it would.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_LucasRematchChat
[BLUE]Alright, I did my part.\pYou're off to see Jenna now, and I'm\noff to take five.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_JennaRematchIntro
[RED]Whoa, whoa, whoa!\pIs that Champion [PLAYER], I see?\nWhat's good, champ?\pYou must be here for a jam sesh,\nyeah? Of course you are!\pI'm so down! Let's jam out!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_JennaRematchDefeat
That's all she wrote!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_JennaRematchChat
[RED]That was some good battling,\nChampion [PLAYER]!\pThat'll do it for me, though.\nI'm sure Thomas is waiting for you.\pHe'll never admit it, but he's been\neager for a rematch ever since the\llast time you two battled!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_ThomasRematchIntro
[BLUE]Champion [PLAYER]. So you've\nreturned.\pIf you're here, that means the other\nthree couldn't defeat you.\pThen, allow me to remind you why I'm\nthe final Elite Four member!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_ThomasRematchDefeat
Excellent. You are indeed worthy of\nyour title.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_EliteFour_ThomasRematchChat
[BLUE]I appreciate the battle we shared.\pHowever, I shouldn't keep you\nhere too long[.]\pYou have a challenger waiting,\nChampion [PLAYER].\pPlease, take the lift to the\nChampion's quarters and I will have\lthem delivered to you.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Rival_Intro
[BLUE]Yo, [PLAYER]!\pI told you I'd be back to take your\ntitle, didn't I?\pMy Pok\emon and I have been training\nreally hard for this day.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Rival_PreBattle
[BLUE]We'll prove to you that we aren't the\nsame old team you remember.\pDon't let up, [PLAYER], because we\nwon't be either!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Rival_PostBattle
Aw, nuts!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Rival_Defeat
[BLUE]Hahaha!\pAwe, man! You're just too strong for\nme, [PLAYER]!\pI'm glad we were able to go all\nout.\pI'm going to go train some more, and\nthen I'll become the next Champion\lfor sure!\pUntil then, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Joey_Intro
[BLUE]This is it[.] It's really it[.]\nThe Champion!\pOh[.] Focus up, Joey[.]\pY'know, they used to laugh at me and\nmy Rattatas.\pBut look at me now. I'm at the top\nof the world!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Joey_PreBattle
[BLUE]I'll prove to you why my Rattatas\nare in the top percentile!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Joey_PostBattle
N-No! My Rattatas!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Joey_Defeat
[BLUE]I can't believe we lost!\pWe can take this in stride, though.\pIt just means that my Rattata and I\nbetter get back to training.\pWe'll show the whole world how\nstrong we are someday!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Selene_Intro
[RED]Hey there, Champion [PLAYER]!\pLooks like you've settled into the\nrole of Champion quite comfortably.\pYou know what that means, don't\nyou?\pYou're the strongest trainer in the\nregion, the one everyone wants to\lbeat!\p[.] Including me!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Selene_PreBattle
[RED]I hope you're ready for a challenge,\n[PLAYER], because I won't go easy\lon you!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Selene_PostBattle
Hmm! Very well done!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Selene_Defeat
[RED]That was a great battle, [PLAYER]!\pYou've really proven why you're the\nbest around.\pI hope you make the most of your\ntime as Kulure's Champion.\pIt was a pleasure battling each\nother. See you!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Alistair_Intro
[BLUE][PLAYER], it has been quite some\ntime[.]\pI've spent a lot of time thinking\nsince we last met.\pMy Pok\emon and I are closer than\never, and it's thanks to your\linfluence.\pI --

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Alistair_PreBattle
[BLUE]No[.] There's nothing left to say, I\nsuppose.\pI will show you the new bond we've\nformed, in battle.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Alistair_PostBattle
I[.] I lost?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Alistair_Defeat
[BLUE]Yes, that went exactly how I\nwould've expected.\pAnd yet, I am not disappointed.\p[PLAYER], thank you for sharing that\nbattle with me.\pWe'll take our leave now, but I'm\nsure we'll meet again soon.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Hawthorne_Intro
[BLUE]Hohoho!\pAre you surprised to see me,\n[PLAYER]?\pWhen I heard you'd become the\nChampion, well[.]\pI just had to build my own team to\nsee how far you've come!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Hawthorne_PreBattle
[BLUE]Now, shall we battle?\pI want to see the results of what\nSelene saw way back then[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Hawthorne_PostBattle
Hohoho! That was quite something!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Hawthorne_Defeat
[BLUE]Truly fantastic battling, [PLAYER]!\pI'm sure Selene enjoyed getting to\ngo all out against you, as well.\pWell, I should be returning to the\nlab soon.\pTake care, [PLAYER]. And do stop by\nto see the conservatory sometime!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Clancy_Intro
[BLUE]Yo, [PLAYER]. It's been a while.\nIt's me, Clancy!\pEna and I have been working hard to\nget a fresh start.\pWhat better way to do that then to\nknock you off your throne and take\lit for myself?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Clancy_PreBattle
[BLUE]Alright, [PLAYER].\pWe've come a long ways since we last\nbattled. We'll prove it!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Clancy_PostBattle
Aw, c'mon[.] We lost?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Clancy_Defeat
[BLUE]Heh, you're alright, [PLAYER].\pI have no hard feelings over our\nbattle.\pI knew I wouldn't win, but it's fun to\ntry, you know?\pCome see Ena sometime.\nI'm sure she'd like that.\pAnyways, take it easy.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ena_Intro
[RED]Champion [PLAYER]! Bet you're\nsurprised to see me, right?\pIt's me, Ena!\pClancy and I have gotten into\nPok\emon battling.\pWe're better than ever now!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ena_PreBattle
[RED]You know why I'm here, right?\pYep! I'm here to take the title of\nChampion from you!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ena_PostBattle
I really thought we had this in the\nbag!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ena_Defeat
[RED]Haha, I suppose it wasn't meant to\nbe after all[.]\pThat's okay with me, though!\pI had a lot of fun battling you.\nNot very often I can say that!\pGood luck with your future battles,\n[PLAYER]!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatM_Intro
[BLUE]Oh wow! It's really Champion [PLAYER]\nin the flesh!\pOh, allow me to introduce myself[.]\nI'm Caleb, your biggest fan!\pI know everything about you and your\nbattling strategy.\pI've even built a team just like\nyours!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatM_PreBattle
[BLUE]I'll show you just how good I am.\pC'mon, let's have a battle!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatM_PostBattle
Whoa! Over in a flash!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatM_Defeat
[BLUE]You're so cool!\nI can't even be mad that I lost!\pI'd better get back to training, so I\ncan battle even better next time.\pI'll be back someday, Champion\n[PLAYER]!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatF_Intro
[RED]Oh[.] My[.] Gosh!!\nIt's Champion [PLAYER]!\pOh, where are my manners[.]\nI'm Emily, and I'm your biggest fan!\pI know everything there is to know\nabout you and your Pok\emon!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatF_PreBattle
[RED]And, with that knowledge, I'll be\nsure to take your title from you!\pNow, let's battle, Champion [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatF_PostBattle
It's over already?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_CopycatF_Defeat
[RED]Awww, you're just too good[.]\pI couldn't have picked a better role\nmodel, that's for sure!\pI need to train harder so I can put\nup a better fight next time.\pI'll be back to battle you again\nsomeday!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Foreigner_Intro
[BLUE]So, you're the Champion[.]\pKulure's Pok\emon trainers are the\nreal deal.\pA lot tougher than the ones back\nin my home region, that's for sure.\pBut[.] I'm a lot tougher than them,\ntoo.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Foreigner_PreBattle
[BLUE]I'm curious if you're really the best\nof the best.\pWell, only one way to find out[.]\nI challenge you to a battle!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Foreigner_PostBattle
Tch[.] Came all this way just to lose.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Foreigner_Defeat
[BLUE]Yep, you're good alright.\nI can accept my defeat with grace.\pBut, know this[.]\pI will be back to take your title. I\nhope you'll be ready for me then!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Collin_Intro
[BLUE]Oh, so you've become the Champion?\nThat's great!\pI've brought my most trusted Pok\emon\npartners with me.\pYou could say they helped me become\nChampion, in another lifetime[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Collin_PreBattle
[BLUE]I wonder if we'll be able to earn\nthe title here, too?\pLet's find out!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Collin_PostBattle
And the battle is over!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Collin_Defeat
[BLUE]You certainly are good, [PLAYER]!\pI hope you and your Pok\emon have\nformed many pleasant memories here.\pAnyways, I gave it my best shot.\pYou'd better register in the Hall\nof Fame now. See you around!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Crystal_Intro
[RED]Wow look at you!\nYou are the Champion now.\pYou've worked tirelessly to achieve\nsuch an accomplishment.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Crystal_PreBattle
[RED]Let's have a battle, see who will\ncome out on top.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Crystal_PostBattle
Farewell, hopefully we meet again.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Crystal_Defeat
[RED]Ahh! Can't win them all I suppose!\pThat's why you are the Champion, I\nsuppose.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Irene_Intro
[RED]My, my[.]\pImagine my surprise to hear you have\nbecome Kulure's Champion.\pI'm sure you know why I'm here, don't\nyou?\pI'm going to repay you for all the\ntrouble you've caused me!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Irene_PreBattle
[RED]Get ready[.]\pThis battle will be over before you\nknow it.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Irene_PostBattle
I don't believe this[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Irene_Defeat
[RED]Ngh[.] How frustrating.\nBut, I am nothing if not persistent.\pI will learn from this loss and\nreturn someday.\pOf that, you can be certain.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ronald_Intro
[BLUE]Well, lookie that!\pThe little brat went and became the\nregion Champion.\pI'd say congratulations, but I'm not\nthat selfless.\pNow, let's dispense with the\npleasantries, shall we?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ronald_PreBattle
[BLUE]I'm Ronald, and I'm Kulure's next\nChampion.\pNice to meetcha.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ronald_PostBattle
We couldn't cut the mustard, huh?

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Ronald_Defeat
[BLUE]Gyahaha!\nWell, that's how things go.\pY'know, in another life I might've\nbeen your rival. Gyahaha!\pI'm just kidding! You should have\nseen the look on your face.\pWell, I lost, so it's only fair that I\nclear out.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Kurtis_Intro
[BLUE]So we meet again[.]\pI assume you are surprised to see\nme, aren't you?\pYou took everything from me, and so\nI've come to return the favour.\pWhen I've claimed your title, I will\nrule this region as it is meant to\lbe!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Kurtis_PreBattle
[BLUE]I grow tired of talking. Allow my\nPok\emon to prove our prowess[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Kurtis_PostBattle
What a pity[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefenseChallenger_Kurtis_Defeat
[BLUE]Geh! Even now I cannot stop you.\pIt matters not.\pI will return one day, to take\neverything you hold dear from you.

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefense_WaitingForChallenger
A challenger should be arriving\nsoon[.]

#org @gText_AscensionTower_TitleDefense_PlayerSucceeded
The challenger has been beaten.\pTime to register my Pok\emon team in\nthe Hall of Fame!

#org @gText_AscensionTower_HallOfFame_PlayerIsDefendingTheirTitle
Okay[.] Time to register my Pok\emon\nteam and head home!

// Restaurant
#org @gText_Restaurant_FirstVisit
Ah, 'ello! Welcome to my\nrestaurant!\pI see you are a new customer! What\nis your name?\p[PLAYER]?\pWelcome, Master [PLAYER]! Please,\nindulge me a moment while I\lexplain ze services I provide.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Explaination
Zis is ze Pok\emon Restaurant, with\ndishes tailored to a Pok\emon's\lunique palate.\lI am ze head chef, Francois.\pZe dishes served 'ere help bring\nout a Pok\emon's true potential,\lhelping zem perform better in\lbattle for a short time.\pBut, it is not a one way\nrelationship, non. We can benefit\lfrom you, too!\pIf you were to donate some Pok\eChips\nto us, we could put zem into our\ldishes to make zem even more\limpactful. Pow!\pAlso, we will be able to buy fresher\ningredients, using ze money you\lspend here.\pC'est magnifique, non? I am sure you\nwill find zis most agreeable.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Intro
Master [PLAYER], what can I get for\nyou?

#org @gText_Restaurant_OptionOrder
Order a Meal

#org @gText_Restaurant_OptionProgress
Progress

#org @gText_Restaurant_OptionDonate
Donate Pok\eChips

#org @gText_Restaurant_OptionExplaination
What is this?

#org @gText_Restaurant_OptionEnd
Nothing

#org @gText_Restaurant_End
Very well. We hope to see you again\nsoon, Master [PLAYER].

#org @gText_Restaurant_MenuPresented
What would you like to order, Master\n[PLAYER]?

#org @gText_Restaurant_MenuLevelPrompt
Which level would you like to\nprepare zis dish at?

#org @gText_Restaurant_MealLevelAndCostPrompt
Zis meal will be prepared at [GREEN]Lvl [BUFFER2][BLUE]\nand will cost \$[BUFFER3].\lIs this acceptable?

#org @gText_Restaurant_MoneySpent
So far you have spent \$[BUFFER1]\nat our establishment.\pWe'll be able to provide better\ningredients after you've spent \l\$[BUFFER2] more.

#org @gText_Restaurant_MoneyRemaining
So far you have spent \$[BUFFER1]\nat our establishment.\pYou have spent enough to get access\nto our freshest ingredients!

#org @gText_Restaurant_ChipsDonated
So far you have donated [BUFFER1]\nPok\eChips. We require [BUFFER2] more\lto provide ze next dish.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationRequirement
Would you like to donate Pok\eChips?

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationRequest
How many would you like to donate?\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER3])

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationNoPokeChips
My apologies, Master [PLAYER].\nYou do not have any Pok\eChips.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationTooManyPokeChips
My apologies, Master [PLAYER].\nYou do not have zat\lmany Pok\eChips.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationMorePokeChipsThanNeeded
I appreciate your generosity, mon\nami, but we do not need zat many\lPok\eChips!

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationLevel2Unlocked
You've now unlocked [GREEN]Lvl 2[BLUE]\ndishes!\pZese dishes are more delicious than\nLvl 1 ones, and will raise stats by\l2 stages!

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationLevel3Requirements
You can unlock our final level,\n[GREEN]Lvl 3[BLUE], by donating [BUFFER2] more\lPok\eChips.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationLevel3Unlocked
You've now unlocked [GREEN]Lvl 3[BLUE]\ndishes!\pZese dishes provide large stat\nbuffs, but come with a cost -\lanother stat will be lowered!\pI've also concocted a most wonderful\ndish - ze Rare Candy Cake!\pZis meal raises all Pok\emon's stats\nby 1, but it can only be prepared\lat level 1. Incroyable, non?

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationMet
Mon ami, you've met our donation\nincentive! Merci!

#org @gText_Restaurant_ChoseNo
Understood.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DonationComplete
Master [PLAYER][.]! Incroyable!\pYou have donated enough Pok\eChips\nto earn our finest dishes.\pMerci, mon ami! I hope you enjoy\nour restaurants offerings.

#org @gText_Restaurant_AttackMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's Attack\nby one stage per level.\pAt level 3, it will also lower your\nPok\emon's Defense by one stage.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DefenseMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's\nDefense by one stage per level.\pAt level 3, it will also lower your\nPok\emon's Attack by one stage.

#org @gText_Restaurant_SpAttackMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's\nSp. Attack by one stage per level.\pAt level 3, it will also lower your\nPok\emon's Sp. Defense by one stage.

#org @gText_Restaurant_SpDefenseMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's\nSp. Defense by one stage per\llevel.\pAt level 3, it will also lower your\nPok\emon's Sp. Attack by one stage.

#org @gText_Restaurant_SpeedMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's\nSpeed by one stage per\llevel.\pAt level 3, it will also lower your\nPok\emon's Accuracy by one stage.

#org @gText_Restaurant_AccuracyMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's\nAccuracy by one stage per\llevel.\pAt level 3, it will also lower your\nPok\emon's Speed by one stage.

#org @gText_Restaurant_EvasionMealDesc
Zis meal raises your Pok\emon's\nEvasion by one stage per\llevel.\pIt can only be served up to Level 2.

#org @gText_Restaurant_AllMealDesc
Zis wondrous meal raises each of\nyour Pok\emon's stats by one stage.\pIt can only be served at Level 1.

#org @gText_Restaurant_MealReplacement
Your Pok\emon are currently full from\nanother meal.\pEating another will replace ze\ncurrent meal's effects. Is zat ok?

#org @gText_Restaurant_PaidForMeal
C'est bon! I will get your meal[.]

#org @gText_Restaurant_PokemonEnjoyMeal
[BLACK]You and your Pok\emon enjoyed the\nmeal prepared for you.[BLUE]

#org @gText_Restaurant_MealConclusion
Thank you for your patronage, Master\n[PLAYER]. I hope you and your\lPok\emon enjoyed your meal.

#org @gText_Restaurant_NotEnoughMoney
I am sorry, but you do not have\nenough money, mon ami[.]

#org @gText_Restaurant_IngredientsNextUnlocked
You've now unlocked [GREEN]Lvl [BUFFER1][BLUE]\ningredients!\pOur dishes are healthier and\ntheir effects will last for longer!

#org @gText_Restaurant_IngredientsFinalLevelUnlocked
You've now unlocked [GREEN]Lvl 5[BLUE]\ningredients, our final level!\pOur dishes are ze healthiest they\ncan be!

#org @gText_Restaurant_DurationNotMax
Zis meal will last for [GREEN][BUFFER1]\nbattle(s)[BLUE].\pYou can unlock our next tier of\ningredients by spending \$[BUFFER2]\lmore.

#org @gText_Restaurant_DurationAtMax
Zis meal will last for [GREEN][BUFFER1]\nbattles[BLUE], ze most we can offer.

#org @gText_Restaurant_IrisIntro
[BLACK]Iris: [RED](Nom[.] Nom[.] Nom[.])\nThis is sooooo delicious!

#org @gText_Restaurant_IrisIntro_StellaFollowUp
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Iris[.] Please eat more\nslowly[.] You'll choke.

#org @gText_Restaurant_StellaIntro
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Oh dear, I don't think I\ncould eat another bite[.]

#org @gText_Restaurant_StellaIntro_IrisFollowUp
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Pass it over here!\nI'll finish it.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_SeesPlayer
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Oh, pardon me. I didn't see\nyou there[.] Can I help you?

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_SeesPlayer
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Hey, I recognize you! You\nchallenged my gym recently.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_RecognizesPlayer
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Oh yes, I do remember you,\nnow that Iris mentions it.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_SuggestsBattle
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Hey, Stella[.]\pThey probably want a battle with us!\nWhat do you say?

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_ConsidersBattle
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Hmm[.] I suppose it has been\na while since we battled together.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_SuggestsBattle
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Are you interested in\nbattling us?

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_DisappointedWithNoBattle
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Aww! I was all ready to throw\ndown, too. Maybe next time.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_DisappointedWithNoBattle
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Yes, perhaps next time[.]

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_PreBattle
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Yessss! C'mon, Stella! Let's\nshow them what we can do!

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_PreBattle
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Don't expect this to be an\neasy battle[.]

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_PreBattle2
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Yep, that's right! Our Pok\emon\nare all fired up from our meals,\ltoo!

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_PostBattle
What a fun battle!

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_PostBattle
Yes, that was quite enjoyable.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_AfterBattle
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Whew, that really hit the\nspot!\pHere, I've got something nice to give\nyou.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_AfterBattle
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Yes, that was very\nenjoyable.\pI, too, have something I'd like to\ngive you.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_OhNo
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Oh no!

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_PreparingToLeave
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Sorry, Stella, but I have to\nrun! I have a gym challenge soon.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_PreparingToLeave
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Oh, Iris[.]\pI suppose I should be going as well.

#org @gText_Restaurant_Iris_Leaves
[BLACK]Iris: [RED]Thanks again for the battle!

#org @gText_Restaurant_Stella_Leaves
[BLACK]Stella: [RED]Good luck!

// Ultra Episode Strings
#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_SakuraPondering
[RED]Hmm[.] If my hypothesis is correct[.]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_SakuraPondering2
[RED]If that's the case, then we'll need\nsome help[.]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_SakuraAcknowledgesPlayer
[RED]Oh, [PLAYER]!\nImpeccable timing.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_SakuraAltarOfEclipseQuestion
[RED]I'll cut to the chase.\pWe've been monitoring the Altar of\nEclipse in Ultra Space.\pYou remember it, surely?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_PlayerRecallsAltar
[RED]Perfect!\pSo, you haven't experienced the\namnesia side effect that most\lFallers do[.]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_PlayerDoesNotRecallAltar
[RED]The Altar of Eclipse is a monument\noutside of Eclipse Village.\pYou encountered a strange creature\nthere, when you passed through\lUltra Space a short while ago.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_MentioningReadings
[RED]We've been monitoring the altar since\nyou visited it.\pJust recently, we've received bizarre\nreadings.\pUltra Wormholes opening suddenly[.]\nAbrupt and fleeting eclipses[.]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_ExtrapolatingOnFindings
[RED]It's truly bizarre.\pWe don't know if these phenomena are\nproblematic or not.\pAnd, we also don't know what's\ncausing them.\pWe need an expert on both Ultra\nSpace and Pok\emon battling to\linvestigate.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_ConcludesFindings
[RED]Yup, you guessed it! You're the\nonly one that fits the bill.\pAll we'd need from you is to\ninvestigate the Altar of Eclipse.\pIf something really is causing the\nreadings, we'll need you to capture\lit so we can analyze it further.\pSounds complicated, but it'll be a\npiece of cake with these!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_GivesBeastBalls
[RED]Those are Beast Balls.\pThey're a specialized Pok\e Ball\ndeveloped by our colleagues in the\lAlola region.\pThese balls are designed to contain\nUltra Beasts.\pNow, I'm not certain that's what we're\ndealing with, but best to be\lprepared, right?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_CommentsOnBuyingBeastBalls
[RED]If you run out, you can get more\nfrom my colleague in the lab.\pUnfortunately, they're quite\nexpensive to make so we'll have to\lcharge you for them.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Intro_Sakura_PreparingToStart
[RED]Now, I'm not asking you to go right\naway, if you have things to do.\pBut[.] Once you have time, we'd really\nappeciate your help.\pTalk to me when you're ready, and we\ncan send you to Eclipse Village.\pAnd, thanks in advance, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_WelcomeBack
[RED]Welcome back, [PLAYER].

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_AsksAboutSource
[RED]Now, how did it go?\pDid you find the source of the\ndisturbances?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_LearnsOfWormholes
[RED]What?\pYou found two Ultra Beasts, and one\ndisappeared into an Ultra Wormhole?\pFurthermore, an eclipse occurred\nwhen the Ultra Wormhole appeared[.]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_Pondering
[RED]That lines up with our earlier\nfindings[.] Fascinating[.]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_AsksToSeeCosmog
[RED]Now, about this Ultra Beast that you\nfound at the Altar[.]\pCan I review it's Pok\edex entry,\nplease?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_DidNotCatchCosmog
[RED]Oh[.] You failed to capture it.\pPlease, prepare yourself and return\nto the Altar of Eclipse.\pThe Ultra Beast must be drawn to it.\nI'm sure it will return.\pThen, once it's caught, we can\nexamine it and move forward with\lour investigation.\pJust come see me when you're ready\nto return to Eclipse Village.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_CaughtCosmog
[RED]Ah, so this is the Ultra Beast known\nas Cosmog.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_FindingsDoNotMatch
[RED]Fascinating, and yet[.]\pThese findings do not match the\nreadings we've received so far.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_WrongUltraBeast
[RED]I am sorry, [PLAYER][.]\pIt seems Cosmog is not the source of\nthe disturbances.\pHowever, it is not a total loss!\pThe Cosmog you encountered does\nshow traces of the same energy we\ltracked.\pFurthermore, it is quite anxious due\nto the ordeal it experienced at\lthe Altar of Eclipse.\p[PLAYER], I believe it would do this\nCosmog good to travel with you.\pAs it grows, we may learn more about\nthe disturbances.\pPlease, take it along with you as\nyou travel.\pNow, with that said -

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_PCResearcher_DetectingReadings
[BLUE]P-Professor Sakura!\pWe've just detected a spike in energy\nreadings.\pNo[.] There are multiple spikes[.]\pIt appears that Ultra Wormholes\nmay be opening all over the region!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_ConfirmingReadings
[RED]What? That can't be possible!\pThe readings were stable until just a\nmoment ago!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_PCResearcher_ConfirmedReadings
[BLUE]Indeed. This might be tied to what\n[PLAYER] experienced at the Altar\lof Eclipse[.]\pWorry not, Professor!\pI've honed in on the readings and\nhave an idea of where these Ultra\lWormholes have opened up.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_CongratulatingResearcher
[RED]Excellent work!\nKeep tracking those readings.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_CommentingOnObligations
[RED]In all our time researching Ultra\nSpace, we have never seen an Ultra\lWormhole open on it's own.\pIt's unclear what is happening, but I\nhave a feeling it isn't good.\pI will stay here to continue\nresearching the wormholes.\p[PLAYER], I apologize, but I must ask\nanother favour of you.\pAs Kulure's Champion and a firsthand\nexplorer of Ultra Space, I feel\lyou are best equipped to\linvestigate the Ultra Wormholes\lthemselves.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_RequestingWormholeClosure
[RED]Ultra Wormholes draw the attention\nof Ultra Beasts.\pWe need you to find these\nwormholes and close them before\lany Ultra Beasts come through.\pPlease, will you do this?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_RequestingWormholeClosure_PlayerTryingToRefuse
[RED][PLAYER], I understand this is a lot\nto ask of you.\pPlease, I must ask you to\nreconsider.\pIf not for me, then for the Kulure\nregion.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_NextSteps1
[RED]Thank you, truly.\pNow, we won't send you out empty\nhanded, of course.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_NextSteps2
[RED]If we're lucky, you won't encounter\nany Ultra Beasts.\pOf course, things are never that\nsimple, are they?\pShould you encounter an\nUltra Beast, please capture it.\pFortunately, Beast Balls are\nequipped for the job.\pCapturing them will prevent them from\nwreaking havoc in our world, of\lcourse.\pHowever, it will also allow us to\nstudy them, which may bring us\lcloser to understanding the\ldisturbances we've detected.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_NextSteps3
[RED]Speak to this man here if you need\nmore Beast Balls.\pHe can also point you in the\ndirection of Ultra Wormholes.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_NextSteps4
[RED]It would be foolish to ask you to\nchallenge Ultra Beasts alone.\pTo support you, we will lend you\nType: Null.\pThis Pok\emon was created in the\nAether Paradise in the Alola\lregion.\pIt is specifically designed to combat\nUltra Beasts.\pTo this end, it has been designated\nthe title of "Beast Killer.\"\pIt is rather unruly, but I am\nconfident you can manage it.\pPlease, take it with you and DO NOT\napproach an Ultra Wormhole without\lit.\pI'll send word ahead to Type: Null's\nguardian letting him know that\lyou'll take it.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostCosmog_Sakura_NextSteps5
[RED]Closing every Ultra Wormhole would\nbe ideal, of course.\pHowever, I am confident that closing\neven 5 of them would be enough.\pWe could handle the remaining Ultra\nWormholes, and also find the source\lof them.\pWith luck, we can ensure no harm\ncomes to the region.\pThank you once again, [PLAYER].\nWe are all in your debt.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_RequestPlayersSupport
I've received word from Professor\nSakura about you.\pYou're here to take Type: Null to\ninvestigate the Ultra Wormholes,\lyes?\pType: Null has a reputation of\nbeing aggressive[.]\pIn reality, it's just scared of this\nplace and it's mission.\pIt needs a confident and caring\ntrainer to help it calm down.\pPlease[.] Assure me you will take\ngood care of Type: Null.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_RequestPlayerSupport_PlayerSaidNo
Then I cannot give you Type: Null in\ngood faith.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_RequestPlayerSupport_PlayerSaidYes
Alright[.] I'll put my faith in you.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_NoRoomForTypeNull
Oh! You don't have room to take it\nwith you.\pPlease, come back when you have\nsome space for it.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_RememberPromise
Make sure you keep your word.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_ReceivedTypeNull
[BLACK][PLAYER] received [GREEN]Type: Null[BLACK]![BLUE]

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_TakeCare
Bring Type: Null with you to any\nUltra Wormholes you find.\pAnd, take care of it.\pIt's scared, but I'm trusting in you\nto help it grow in confidence.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_RecognizeSilvally
Wh-what's this?\pType: Null has[.] Evolved?!\pThis is truly incredible!\pTyp - Err[.] Silvally was always a\nmisunderstood creature.\pFor the two of you to build a bond\nthis strong in such a short time[.]\pWhy, it touches my heart.\pPlease, take these, I insist!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_ObtainedMemories
[BLACK][PLAYER] obtained a set of Memory\ndiscs!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_MemoryDiscsExplained
[BLUE]These Memory discs were designed to\nbring out Silvally's latent power.\pEach holds data on a powerful\nPok\emon of each respective type.\pSilvally has a special ability called\n[GREEN]RKS System[BLUE].\pBy holding one of these discs, it can\nchange it's own type, as well as\lthe type of it's Multi-Attack move,\lto match that disc.\pI'm certain someone like you can make\ngood use of it.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_GivenSilvally
[BLUE]Seeing how close you two are now[.]\pWell, it would feel wrong to take\nSilvally away from you.\pVery well!\pFrom this moment forth, Silvally is\nyours!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_ObtainedSilvally
[BLACK][PLAYER] became Silvally's trainer!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_SilvallyCanBeNicknamed
Silvally can now be nicknamed as you\nsee fit.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_TypeNullResearcher_TakeCareOfSilvally
[BLUE]Please continue to take good care of\nSilvally.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_MachineryResearcher_CongratulatingPlayer
[PLAYER], congratulations are in order\nfor catching Necrozma.\pOh, I should explain myself,\nheheh.\pOnce Professor Sakura realized that\nNecrozma was responsible for the\leclipses, she contacted us.\pShe was so confident that you'd\ncatch it that she told us to\lprepare something for you.\pHere, take it!

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_MachineryResearcher_ObtainedNecrozmaFusionItems
[BLACK][PLAYER] received the [GREEN]N-Solarizer[BLACK] and\n[GREEN]N-Lunarizer[BLACK]![BLUE]

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_MachineryResearcher_ExplainNecrozmaFusionItems
Those are the [GREEN]N-Solarizer[BLUE] and [GREEN]N-\nLunarizer[BLUE].\pThey can be used to agreeably\nfuse or unfuse Necrozma with\leither Solgaleo or Lunala,\lrespectively.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_MachineryResearcher_PostNecrozma
Take good care of Necrozma.\nWe'll be counting on you.

#org @gText_DaimynCityFacilities_IRF_MachineryResearcher_PostNecrozma_NotCaught
Ah, [PLAYER].\pProfessor Sakura told me about your\nencounter with Necrozma.\pAfter hearing that, I got right to\nwork on creating a new device.\pHowever, it isn't ready yet[.]\pIf you capture Necrozma, please\nreturn to see me.\pI'm sure by then I'll have finished\nmy work.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_UltraBeastHunt_Sakura_PromptForDestination
[RED][PLAYER], it's good to see you.\nWhat can I help you with?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoToEclipseVillage
Go to Eclipse Village

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_TrackTheDistrubances
Track the disturbances

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoToDiasOfLight
Go to Dias of Light

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_Nothing
Nothing for now!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_UltraBeastHunt_Sakura_ChoseNothing
[RED]Understood. Please speak with me if\nyou change your mind.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_UltraBeastHunt_Sakura_RequirementsToTrackDisturbance
[RED]Finding the source of the\ndisturbances will be quite\ldifficult.\pTo do so, we'll need a stronger\nunderstanding of both Ultra\lWormholes and the energy that\lproduces them.\pWith your experience, I'm certain we\ncould make great strides in our\lresearch.\pClosing Ultra Wormholes and studying\nyour Cosmog would surely help us.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_UltraBeastHunt_Sakura_UltraBeastCount_Requirement
[RED]I've received word that you've dealt\nwith [BUFFER1] Ultra Wormholes.\pPlease, continue on until you've\nhandled at least 5.\pThat should be enough for us to\nbetter understand how they behave.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostUltraWormholes_Sakura_UltraBeastCount_Sufficient
[RED]You've done great work, [PLAYER].\pThanks to your efforts in closing the\nUltra Wormholes, we're starting to\lunderstand how they behave.\pI'm confident we can stabilize them\nlong enough for someone to travel\lthrough.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostUltraWormholes_Sakura_NoSolgaleoOrLunala
[RED]Unfortunately, we would need to\nbetter understand the energy\lsource causing them to do so.\pHmm[.] I recall it being similar to the\nreadings coming from your Cosmog[.]\pIt stands to reason that it's energy\nwould grow stronger as it does,\lyes?\pI've read reports from our\ncolleagues in the Alola Region.\pThey tell of Pok\emon called [GREEN]Solgaleo\n[RED]and [GREEN]Lunala[RED], which could open Ultra\lWormholes at will.\pWhat's more, their papers imply\nthese Beasts evolved from a\lCosmog[.]\p[PLAYER], if your Cosmog ever\nevolves, please bring it here.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostUltraWormholes_Sakura_HasCaughtSolgaleoOrLunala
[RED]Furthermore, you were able to\nevolve your Cosmog into [BUFFER1]!\pThe energy coming from it is\nimmense.\pIt isn't a stretch to say it has\nresulted in a breakthrough in our\lresearch.\pAs a result of all your efforts, I\nam confident we can pinpoint the\lsource of the disturbances.\pPlease, be patient with us for a\nmoment as we confirm.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostUltraWormholes_Sakura_StudyingSolgaleoOrLunala
[RED]Hmm[.] I see.\pYes, this energy reading is quite\nsimilar to the one we discovered.\pIt is remarkably more stable\nthough.\pI see[.] So this is how it maintains a\nstable Ultra Wormhole[.]\pIf I scan for disturbances using this\nwavelength, then[.] Aha!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostUltraWormholes_Sakura_FoundNecrozma
[RED][PLAYER], I have good news and bad\nnews.\pThanks to your findings, we were able\nto pinpoint the source of the\lUltra Wormholes.\p[PLAYER][.] It is not a stretch to say\nthis was only possible thanks to\lyour hard work.\pNow, the bad news[.]\pYou may recall an increase in\nabnormal eclipses as of late.\pIt appears the cause is residing at\nthis same location.\pI have dubbed it the [GREEN]Dias of\nLight[RED].\pOur readings have determined that\nUltra Wormholes are absorbing light\land directing it there.\pOnce it arrives, it appears to be\nabsorbed into an unknown entity.\p[PLAYER], if left unchecked, this\nentity could leave the dias in\lpursuit of more light.\pIt could threaten the Kulure region,\nif not the entire world.\pAnd so, I have one final request for\nyou, as our champion.\pTravel to the Dias of Light and put\na stop to the entity absorbing\llight.\pIt would be best to prepare for\nanything and bring Type: Null with\lyou.\pOf course, I will also be joining\nyou.\pWe don't know what will happen, so\nyou'll need an expert on Ultra\lSpace with you.\pAnd, well, my pride as a\nresearcher simply will not let me\lmiss this opportunity!\pThis is a lot to ask, I know[.]\pTake time to prepare and come see\nme when you are ready.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoingToDiasOfLight_Prompt
[RED]This will be a risky expedition.\nWe don't know what we'll find there.\pIt would be wise to stock up on\nBeast Balls, just to be safe[.]\pAre you sure you're prepared to go?

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoingToDiasOfLight_ChoseNo
[RED]Take your time.\nWe can go when you are ready.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoingToDiasOfLight_NoBeastKiller
[RED][PLAYER][.] We don't know what we'll\nfind at the Dias of Light.\pIt would be unwise to go without\nType: Null, for protection[.]\pPlease, return with it when you are\nprepared to go.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoingToDiasOfLight_ChoseYes
[RED]Alright, let's take our positions\nbefore the machine.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Sakura_GoingToDiasOfLight
[RED]We're ready to depart.\nPlease, start the machine.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_Researcher_GoingToDiasOfLight
[BLUE]Yes, ma'am!\nGood luck on your expedition.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_WelcomeBack
[RED]Welcome back to Kulure, [PLAYER].\pPlease, come here a moment.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_ExplainingResearcherSupport
[RED]Thanks to your efforts, Kulure is\nsafe once again.\pI got in touch with the researchers\nhere once we learned that Necrozma\lwas responsible.\pPlease, speak with them. I'm sure\nit'll be worth your while.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_UltraWormholesRemain
[RED]There are still [BUFFER1] Ultra\nWormholes left unaccounted for.\pPlease speak with my researcher when\nyou have time to close them.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_NoUltraWormholesRemain
[RED]You've closed every Ultra Wormhole\nwe've detected.\pThank you, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_NecrozmaUncaught
[RED]And, there's still Necrozma[.]\pIt's calm for now, but we can't be\ncertain it won't lash out again.\pPlease, capture it.\pI'm certain a trainer like you can\ncalm it down.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_ExplainingTravelToUltraSpace
[RED]And, as always, you can speak to me\nif you want to travel to Ultra\lSpace.\pWe can return to either Eclipse\nVillage or the Dias of Light.

#org @gText_UltraEpisode_PostNecrozma_Sakura_Farewell
[RED]Once again, thank you for your\nefforts, [PLAYER].\pIf not for you, Kulure could've[.]\nWell, let's not dwell on what-ifs!\pNow, I'm certain you're busy, so I\nwon't keep you much longer.\pTake care, [PLAYER].\nYou'll always be welcome here.
